//@version=6
// ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
//  Liquidity Sweep Model [LSM] 1H/5M — Pine Script v6 STRATEGY (Phase 2 · backtest companion)
//
//  PHASE 2 NOTES
//  ─────────────
//  This file reuses the Phase-1 engine verbatim (same inputs, state machine, gates, grading,
//  sizing and virtual trade management). On top of it it adds:
//   • Order routing: the engine's decisions are mirrored with strategy.entry/exit/close
//     (E1/E2b as limit orders, E2a/E3/E5/E5-add as market orders on the signal close,
//     TP1/TP2/runner + moving stop as strategy.exit, time stop / invalidation / EOD as close).
//   • An "R ledger": every completed virtual trade is recorded with its realised R
//     (vs the planned risk budget) and bucketed by entry model, C1 grade, second-sweep
//     risk and session window → stats table (n, win %, avg R, total R, profit factor),
//     trade log, per-trade R labels, data-window series for export.
//   • One position at a time: a strategy cannot be long and short simultaneously, so a
//     setup is not armed while the opposite direction is ARMED / in a trade (gate "opposite").
//  The R ledger is computed by the engine (deterministic, identical to the indicator's
//  dashboard). The Strategy Tester P&L comes from TradingView's broker emulator and can
//  differ slightly (intrabar fill assumptions, gaps, lot rounding, qty = 0 when the account
//  is too small for one lot). Tune thresholds from the R ledger; use the tester for equity.
// ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
//
//  MODEL SUMMARY
//  ─────────────
//  Runs on a 5-minute chart (LTF). Reads 1H structure (HTF) and a 4H/Daily bias cross-check.
//    Step 1  1H bias = direction of the latest 1H BOS (body close beyond the last confirmed swing).
//    Step 2  Location: 1H dealing range + premium/discount, ranked liquidity pools, untapped 1H
//            FVG/OB zones, position inside the current 1H candle, room to target (R:R gate).
//    Step 3  Sweep candle C1 (wick through an unconsumed pool, close back inside) graded A/B/C.
//    Step 4  Second-sweep risk LOW/MODERATE/HIGH from deeper liquidity, rank, timing, alignment.
//    Step 5  Displacement + 5M market-structure shift (structural or internal).
//    Step 6  Entry models E1 FVG retest, E2 tiered, E3 continuation, E4 1M refine, E5 2nd sweep.
//    Step 7  Stops (Structural / Sweep low / Aggressive / Auto), sizing, TP1/TP2/runner + R.
//    Step 8  Virtual trade management: time stop, BE, partial + trail, one re-entry, invalidation.
//  Longs and shorts are mirror images. Internally every direction-sensitive price is stored in
//  "normalised" space n = price × direction (+1 long / −1 short) so ONE code path serves both:
//  for a short, nHigh = −low, nLow = −high, nClose = −close. Real price = n × direction.
//
//  STATE MACHINE (per direction, one live setup each)
//  ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
//   IDLE ─ sweep (pre-gates pass) ─► C1_DETECTED
//   C1_DETECTED ─ risk HIGH ─► WATCH_SECOND_SWEEP   (HIGH risk has priority over grade)
//               ─ grade C ───► WAIT_RECLAIM ─(reclaim ≤ reclaimBars, MSS ≤ mssWindow)─► MSS_CONFIRMED / CANCELLED
//               ─ grade A/B ─► WAIT_MSS ─(MSS ≤ mssWindow)─► MSS_CONFIRMED / CANCELLED or WATCH_SECOND_SWEEP
//               (acceptance: acceptBars closes beyond the level → CANCELLED, level consumed)
//   MSS_CONFIRMED ─ WEAK displacement or risk HIGH ─► WATCH_SECOND_SWEEP
//                 ─ gates + score ─► ARMED (E1 limit) / IN_TRADE (E2 tier 1, E3, E5 at close) / SKIPPED
//   WATCH_SECOND_SWEEP ─(C1 low retaken + reclaim + 2nd MSS)─► ARMED(E5) / timeout → CANCELLED
//   ARMED ─ limit touched ─► IN_TRADE ─ TP1 ─► TRAIL ─► DONE (TP2/runner) / STOPPED / SCRATCHED
//   STOPPED (first time, fresh low just below C1) ─► REENTRY_WATCH ─(reclaim + MSS)─► E5 re-entry, half risk
//   Any active state ─► INVALID on hard invalidation (3rd sweep, 1H close beyond swept zone,
//                       1H BOS against) — direction blocked for the rest of the session/day.
//   State codes (data window / screener): 0 IDLE 1 C1 2 WAIT_RECLAIM 3 WAIT_MSS 4 MSS_CONFIRMED
//   5 WATCH_SECOND_SWEEP 6 ARMED 7 IN_TRADE 8 TRAIL 9 DONE 10 STOPPED 11 SCRATCHED 12 CANCELLED
//   13 SKIPPED 14 INVALID 15 REENTRY_WATCH
//
//  NON-REPAINT GUARANTEES
//  ──────────────────────
//   • All state transitions, drawings of signals and alert() calls happen inside
//     `if barstate.isconfirmed` — i.e. on the closing tick of a 5M bar only.
//   • Every HTF value (1H, 4H/D, D, W) is requested as `expr[1]` with lookahead_on, i.e. the
//     previous, fully-closed HTF bar. HTF events are consumed on the first 5M bar of the next HTF
//     bar (timeframe.change(htfTF)), identical in history and real time.
//   • Pivots (ta.pivothigh/low) are used only after their right-side bars have closed
//     (lag = pivot length bars). No future bars are referenced anywhere.
//   • request.security_lower_tf (E4) only reads 1M bars inside already-closed 5M bars.
//
//  INPUT GLOSSARY (defaults)
//  ─────────────────────────
//   htfTF=60 biasTF=240 htfPivotLen=3 htfChochLen=1 biasLookback=50 allowReversals=false
//   eqTol=0.1×ATR(1H) discountMax=0.5 earlyMinutes=20 maxZones=20 ltfIntPivotLen=2
//   acceptBars=2 dojiPct=0.10 reclaimBars=3 nearTicks=3 deepZoneATR=1.0 starterPct=33
//   mssWindow=6 dispBodyMult=1.5 dispClosePct=25 ltfStructPivotLen=5 rvolMin=1.5 fvgWaitBars=2
//   tierPct=50 consATR=0.8 secondSweepBars=24 minBounceATR=0.5 armedExpiry=24
//   bufferTicks=2 structPadATR=0.2 minRR=2.0 tp1Pct=40 tp1FallbackR=1.0 riskPct=0.5 lotSize=1
//   timeStopBars=7
//
//  INTERPRETATIONS OF AMBIGUOUS RULES (see pine/README.md for the reasoning)
//   1. 1H CHoCH = close beyond a minor (htfChochLen) 1H pivot AGAINST the current bias, before a
//      structural BOS. Counter-trend setups need allowReversals AND choch == setup direction.
//   2. Rank-4-only sweeps are rejected unless C1 also taps an untapped 1H FVG/OB (toggle).
//   3. E1 for MODERATE displacement: CE by default (Step 6 table); "Top edge" selectable.
//   4. Auto stop: Structural (risk ≥ MOD or deeper pool) → Sweep low (grade A) →
//      Aggressive (E2/E3 + STRONG) → Sweep low. A flagged deeper pool escalates ANY mode to Structural.
//   5. MODERATE risk: starter (E1, starterPct of size) + E5 add of the remaining size on a 2nd sweep.
//   6. 2nd sweep needs ≥ 2 bars after C1 and a bounce ≥ minBounceATR × ATR before the retest.
//   7. "≥50% to TP1 covered" is measured from the sweep low; it blocks market entries (E2/E3/E5)
//      and is only a flag for E1 limit orders.
//   8. E5 entries score the "2nd-sweep risk LOW" point (the 2nd sweep resolved that risk).
//   9. R is measured against the setup's FULL planned risk budget (a starter-only win shows ≈0.33×).
//
//  KNOWN LIMITATIONS
//  ─────────────────
//   • Pivot confirmation lag: 1H swings appear htfPivotLen 1H bars late, 5M structural swings
//     ltfStructPivotLen bars late; levels/zones become usable only after confirmation.
//   • 1H "position" (minutes into hour) follows TradingView's HTF bar boundaries; on US stocks
//     the first 1H bar is 09:30–10:30 and the last is 30 minutes.
//   • request.security_lower_tf: 1M history is limited by plan (typically a few thousand 1M
//     bars), so E4 is unavailable on older history; PSX symbols may have sparse 1M data.
//   • Session windows use fixed session strings: PSX half-days / Friday timetable, holidays and
//     ad-hoc closures are NOT modelled; session-end detection uses a time-gap heuristic
//     (gap > 3 bars) on regular-hours charts. Asia/London pools only exist when the chart has
//     data in those hours (extended-hours data for US stocks).
//   • Virtual trade tracking assumes perfect limit fills at the touch, stop fills at the stop
//     price, same-bar stop priority over targets, no slippage, commissions or partial fills.
//   • Intrabar order is unknown: on the bar a limit fills, targets are not evaluated.
//   • biasLookback is counted in bars of the requested timeframe (1H bars for 1H, 4H bars for 4H).
//   • Bias-TF swings use htfPivotLen as well (one input for both HTF structures).
//   • News blackout times are entered manually in the market timezone (no calendar feed).
//   • Rank-1 key levels refresh at the new day/week (an unswept older PDH is dropped).
//   • Drawings beyond 500 per type are garbage-collected by TradingView oldest-first.
//   • Strategies cannot use alertcondition(); use alert() (Any alert() function call) for events.
// ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
strategy("Liquidity Sweep Model [LSM] 1H/5M · Strategy", shorttitle = "LSM 1H/5M S", overlay = true, initial_capital = 10000, default_qty_type = strategy.fixed, default_qty_value = 1, pyramiding = 3, process_orders_on_close = true, commission_type = strategy.commission.percent, commission_value = 0.0, slippage = 0, max_boxes_count = 500, max_lines_count = 500, max_labels_count = 500, max_bars_back = 1000)

// ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
// INPUTS
// ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
string G0 = "0 · Chart guard"
string G1 = "Step 1 · 1H bias & structure"
string G2 = "Step 2 · Location & liquidity"
string G3 = "Step 3 · Sweep candle (C1)"
string G4 = "Step 4 · Second-sweep risk"
string G5 = "Step 5 · Displacement & MSS"
string G6 = "Step 6 · Entry models"
string G7 = "Step 7 · Stops, sizing, targets"
string G8 = "Step 8 · Trade management"
string GT = "Timing & session filters"
string GV = "Visuals"
string GA = "Alerts"

ltfExpected       = input.timeframe("5", "Expected chart (LTF) timeframe", group = G0, tooltip = "The model runs on a 5-minute chart. If the chart timeframe differs, a warning is shown and signals are disabled.")
allowAnyTF        = input.bool(false, "Override: allow signals on any chart timeframe", group = G0, tooltip = "Keep off unless you deliberately want to test another LTF.")

htfTF             = input.timeframe("60", "Structure timeframe (HTF)", group = G1, tooltip = "Step 1: 1H swing highs/lows, BOS, dealing range, FVG/OB zones.")
biasTF            = input.timeframe("240", "Bias cross-check timeframe (4H or D)", group = G1, tooltip = "4H (can switch to Daily) bias computed the same way. htfAligned = bias4H == bias1H.")
htfPivotLen       = input.int(3, "1H pivot length", minval = 1, maxval = 10, group = G1, tooltip = "Detect 1H swing highs/lows with confirmed pivots (htfPivotLen).")
htfChochLen       = input.int(1, "1H CHoCH (minor swing) pivot length", minval = 1, maxval = 5, group = G1, tooltip = "CHoCH = 1H close beyond a minor swing against the current bias (interpretation, see header).")
biasLookback      = input.int(50, "Bias lookback (HTF bars)", minval = 5, maxval = 500, group = G1, tooltip = "No BOS within biasLookback 1H bars → bias NONE → no trade.")
allowReversals    = input.bool(false, "Allow reversals (needs 1H CHoCH)", group = G1, tooltip = "Counter-trend setups are allowed only if a 1H CHoCH has printed in the setup's direction.")

eqTol             = input.float(0.1, "Equal highs/lows tolerance (× ATR)", minval = 0.0, step = 0.01, group = G2, tooltip = "Equal = two or more confirmed 1H pivots within eqTol × ATR(1H,14). Also used for the 'equal low' second sweep (× ATR 5M).")
discountMax       = input.float(0.5, "Max range position for longs (min for shorts = 1 − x)", minval = 0.1, maxval = 1.0, step = 0.05, group = G2, tooltip = "Longs only if the sweep low is below eq (discount); shorts only above eq (premium). 0.4 = stricter 40% threshold.")
earlyMinutes      = input.int(20, "Early-in-hour minutes", minval = 1, maxval = 59, group = G2, tooltip = "earlyInHour = minutesIntoHour <= earlyMinutes.")
maxZones          = input.int(20, "Max stored zones / levels per list", minval = 5, maxval = 100, group = G2, tooltip = "Bounded memory: zone list, internal-pool list and 1H-swing list are capped; oldest consumed/tapped deleted first.")
usePDWL           = input.bool(true, "Rank 1 · previous day / week high & low", group = G2)
use1HSwings       = input.bool(true, "Rank 2 · 1H equal highs/lows & clean swings", group = G2)
useSessLiq        = input.bool(true, "Rank 3 · session highs/lows", group = G2)
asiaSess          = input.session("2000-0000", "Asia session", group = G2)
londonSess        = input.session("0200-0500", "London session", group = G2)
liqTz             = input.string("America/New_York", "Asia/London session timezone", group = G2)
useIntPools       = input.bool(true, "Rank 4 · internal 5M swing points", group = G2)
ltfIntPivotLen    = input.int(2, "Internal 5M pivot length", minval = 1, maxval = 5, group = G2, tooltip = "Rank 4 pools and internal MSS use confirmed 5M pivots of this length.")
allowRank4Zone    = input.bool(true, "Rank-4 sweep tradeable only with 1H zone tap", group = G2, tooltip = "Rank 4 is 'not tradeable alone': a rank-4-only sweep needs sweepIntoHtfZone. Off = never tradeable.")
obLookback        = input.int(10, "1H OB lookback (bars before BOS)", minval = 2, maxval = 30, group = G2, tooltip = "1H order block = last opposite candle before a 1H BOS displacement.")

acceptBars        = input.int(2, "Acceptance bars", minval = 1, maxval = 5, group = G3, tooltip = "If acceptBars consecutive 5M closes are beyond the level → breakout, cancel, consume level.")
dojiPct           = input.float(0.10, "Doji body (% of range)", minval = 0.01, maxval = 0.5, step = 0.01, group = G3, tooltip = "B grade includes doji: body < dojiPct of range.")
reclaimBars       = input.int(3, "C-grade reclaim bars", minval = 1, maxval = 10, group = G3, tooltip = "C upgrade: within reclaimBars a candle closes above C1's body midpoint (or engulfs) AND a 5M MSS prints.")
nearTicks         = input.int(3, "C warning: close within N ticks of level", minval = 0, maxval = 50, group = G3)

deepZoneATR       = input.float(1.0, "Deeper-liquidity distance (× ATR 5M)", minval = 0.1, step = 0.1, group = G4, tooltip = "Risk factor: another unconsumed rank 1–3 pool or untapped 1H FVG/OB within deepZoneATR × ATR(5M,14) beyond C1.")
starterPct        = input.int(33, "Starter size % (MODERATE risk)", minval = 5, maxval = 100, group = G4, tooltip = "MODERATE → starter on C1; main size reserved for the E5 reclaim.")

mssWindow         = input.int(6, "MSS window (bars after C1)", minval = 2, maxval = 20, group = G5)
dispBodyMult      = input.float(1.5, "Displacement body ≥ × avg body", minval = 0.5, step = 0.1, group = G5)
dispClosePct      = input.int(25, "Displacement close in top % of range", minval = 5, maxval = 50, group = G5)
ltfStructPivotLen = input.int(5, "Structural 5M pivot length", minval = 2, maxval = 10, group = G5, tooltip = "Structural MSS = body close beyond the origin of the leg into C1 (extreme since the last structural swing).")
rvolMin           = input.float(1.5, "RVOL threshold", minval = 0.5, step = 0.1, group = G5, tooltip = "rvol = volume / sma(volume,20). Ignored when the symbol has no volume.")
fvgWaitBars       = input.int(2, "Bars to wait for FVG after MSS", minval = 0, maxval = 4, group = G5, tooltip = "If the MSS candle is the displacement candle, its FVG is only confirmed by the next bar.")

tierPct           = input.int(50, "E2 tier-1 %", minval = 10, maxval = 90, group = G6, tooltip = "E2: tierPct at the MSS candle close, remainder at the FVG top edge.")
e1ModEdge         = input.string("CE (50%)", "E1 price for MODERATE displacement", options = ["CE (50%)", "Top edge"], group = G6, tooltip = "Step 6 table says CE for MODERATE; the decision table says top edge. Pick one.")
useE3             = input.bool(true, "Enable E3 continuation", group = G6)
consATR           = input.float(0.8, "E3 consolidation range ≤ × ATR", minval = 0.1, step = 0.1, group = G6)
secondSweepBars   = input.int(24, "E5 window (bars after C1)", minval = 4, maxval = 100, group = G6)
minBounceATR      = input.float(0.5, "E5 min bounce before retest (× ATR)", minval = 0.0, step = 0.1, group = G6, tooltip = "Interpretation: a 'second' sweep needs price to have moved away first.")
useLTFRefine      = input.bool(false, "E4 · 1M refinement (request.security_lower_tf)", group = G6)
armedExpiry       = input.int(24, "ARMED limit expiry (bars)", minval = 3, maxval = 200, group = G6)

stopMode          = input.string("Auto", "Stop mode", options = ["Auto", "Structural", "Sweep low", "Aggressive"], group = G7, tooltip = "Structural: beyond 1H FVG/OB or larger pool beyond C1. Sweep low: beyond C1 wick ± buffer. Aggressive: beyond displacement candle / 5M FVG. Auto: see header.")
bufferTicks       = input.int(2, "Stop buffer (ticks)", minval = 0, maxval = 100, group = G7)
structPadATR      = input.float(0.2, "Structural pad when no deeper ref (× ATR)", minval = 0.0, step = 0.05, group = G7)
accountSize       = input.float(10000, "Account size", minval = 1, group = G7)
riskPct           = input.float(0.5, "Risk % per trade", minval = 0.01, step = 0.05, group = G7)
useFixedRisk      = input.bool(false, "Use fixed risk amount instead", group = G7)
fixedRisk         = input.float(50, "Fixed risk amount", minval = 0.01, group = G7)
lotSize           = input.int(1, "Lot size (1 US; PSX board lot e.g. 500)", minval = 1, group = G7)
tp1Pct            = input.int(40, "TP1 partial %", minval = 1, maxval = 100, group = G7)
tp1FallbackR      = input.float(1.0, "TP1 fallback (R) if no internal pool", minval = 0.5, step = 0.25, group = G7)
useRunner         = input.bool(true, "Runner to 4H draw (only when aligned)", group = G7)
minRR             = input.float(2.0, "Min R:R to final target", minval = 0.5, step = 0.1, group = G7)

timeStopBars      = input.int(7, "Time stop bars", minval = 6, maxval = 9, group = G8, tooltip = "If TP1 is not hit within timeStopBars and the 5M chart prints a lower high → Scratch at BE.")
reentryOn         = input.bool(true, "Allow one E5 re-entry after stop", group = G8)
flatEOD           = input.bool(true, "Intraday: flatten / cancel on the last regular bar", group = G8, tooltip = "Uses session.islastbar_regular. Off = setups and virtual trades may carry overnight.")

preset            = input.string("US", "Market preset", options = ["US", "PSX", "Custom"], group = GT)
usMain            = input.session("0930-1600", "US · regular session", group = GT)
usOpen            = input.session("0930-1000", "US · opening volatility", group = GT)
usPrime           = input.session("1000-1130", "US · prime window", group = GT)
usMid             = input.session("1130-1330", "US · midday", group = GT)
usAft             = input.session("1330-1500", "US · afternoon (secondary)", group = GT)
psxMain           = input.session("0930-1530", "PSX · regular session", group = GT)
psxOpen           = input.session("0930-1015", "PSX · opening volatility (30–60 min)", group = GT)
psxPrime          = input.session("1015-1230", "PSX · prime window", group = GT)
psxMid            = input.session("1230-1400", "PSX · midday low volume", group = GT)
psxAft            = input.session("1400-1530", "PSX · afternoon", group = GT)
cMain             = input.session("0930-1600", "Custom · regular session", group = GT)
cOpen             = input.session("0930-1000", "Custom · opening volatility", group = GT)
cPrime            = input.session("1000-1130", "Custom · prime window", group = GT)
cMid              = input.session("1130-1330", "Custom · midday", group = GT)
cAft              = input.session("1330-1500", "Custom · afternoon", group = GT)
cTz               = input.string("America/New_York", "Custom · timezone", group = GT)
middayMode        = input.string("Skip", "Midday handling", options = ["Skip", "Reduce 50%", "Allow"], group = GT)
newsTimes         = input.string("", "News times HH:MM, comma separated (market tz)", group = GT, tooltip = "e.g. 08:30,10:00,14:00 — no new entries within ± newsMins.")
newsMins          = input.int(15, "News blackout ± minutes", minval = 0, maxval = 120, group = GT)

showLevels        = input.bool(true, "Show liquidity levels", group = GV)
showIntLevels     = input.bool(true, "Show internal (rank 4) levels", group = GV)
showRange         = input.bool(true, "Show 1H dealing range", group = GV)
showPD            = input.bool(true, "Premium / discount shading", group = GV)
showZones         = input.bool(true, "Show 1H FVG / OB zones", group = GV)
showPlans         = input.bool(true, "Show entry plans", group = GV)
showTradeBoxes    = input.bool(true, "Show trade boxes (risk / reward)", group = GV, tooltip = "Position-tool style boxes: red = entry → stop (−1R), green = entry → final target (TP2, or TP1 if none).")
showRejected      = input.bool(false, "Show rejected sweeps (debug)", group = GV)
showDash          = input.bool(true, "Show dashboard", group = GV)
dashPos           = input.string("Top right", "Dashboard position", options = ["Top right", "Top left", "Bottom right", "Bottom left", "Middle right"], group = GV)
colBull           = input.color(#26a69a, "Bullish", group = GV)
colBear           = input.color(#ef5350, "Bearish", group = GV)
colHiLiq          = input.color(#ff9800, "Buy-side liquidity (highs)", group = GV)
colLoLiq          = input.color(#2196f3, "Sell-side liquidity (lows)", group = GV)
colEntry          = input.color(#7e57c2, "Entry", group = GV)
colStop           = input.color(#e53935, "Stop", group = GV)
colTarget         = input.color(#43a047, "Targets", group = GV)
colA              = input.color(#2e7d32, "C1 grade A", group = GV)
colB              = input.color(#f9a825, "C1 grade B", group = GV)
colC              = input.color(#c62828, "C1 grade C", group = GV)
colNeutral        = input.color(#9e9e9e, "Neutral / skipped", group = GV)

alC1              = input.bool(true, "C1 detected", group = GA)
alReclaim         = input.bool(true, "C-grade reclaim", group = GA)
alMSS             = input.bool(true, "MSS confirmed", group = GA)
alArmed           = input.bool(true, "Setup ARMED", group = GA)
alEntry           = input.bool(true, "Entry triggered", group = GA)
alE5              = input.bool(true, "E5 second-sweep reclaim", group = GA)
alTP1             = input.bool(true, "TP1 hit", group = GA)
alTP2             = input.bool(true, "TP2 / runner hit", group = GA)
alBE              = input.bool(true, "Move SL to BE", group = GA)
alTrail           = input.bool(false, "Trail stop moved", group = GA)
alTime            = input.bool(true, "Time stop — scratch", group = GA)
alReentry         = input.bool(true, "Re-entry signal", group = GA)
alInvalid         = input.bool(true, "Setup invalidated", group = GA)
alExit            = input.bool(true, "Stopped / closed", group = GA)

string GB = "Phase 2 · Backtest & statistics"
placeOrders       = input.bool(true, "Route orders to the Strategy Tester", group = GB, tooltip = "Off = statistics only (R ledger), no broker-emulator orders.")
sizeFromEquity    = input.bool(true, "Size from strategy equity (else Account size)", group = GB, tooltip = "Risk amount = equity × riskPct. Set Properties → Initial capital to your account.")
showStats         = input.bool(true, "Show R statistics table", group = GB)
statsPos          = input.string("Bottom right", "Statistics position", options = ["Top right", "Top left", "Bottom right", "Bottom left", "Middle right"], group = GB)
logRows           = input.int(8, "Trade log rows", minval = 0, maxval = 20, group = GB)
showTradeLabels   = input.bool(true, "Label realised R on each closed trade", group = GB)
statsFrom         = input.time(timestamp("2000-01-01T00:00:00"), "Count trades from", group = GB, tooltip = "Only trades closed after this time enter the statistics (walk-forward splits).")

// ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
// CONSTANTS
// ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
int ST_IDLE      = 0
int ST_C1        = 1
int ST_WAIT_REC  = 2
int ST_WAIT_MSS  = 3
int ST_MSS       = 4
int ST_WATCH2    = 5
int ST_ARMED     = 6
int ST_INTRADE   = 7
int ST_TRAIL     = 8
int ST_DONE      = 9
int ST_STOPPED   = 10
int ST_SCRATCHED = 11
int ST_CANCELLED = 12
int ST_SKIPPED   = 13
int ST_INVALID   = 14
int ST_REWATCH   = 15

// ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
// TYPES
// ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
// Liquidity pool level (real prices). side +1 = buy-side (highs, swept by shorts' C1),
// side −1 = sell-side (lows, swept by longs' C1). kind: 0 key (PDH/PWH), 1 = 1H swing, 2 session, 3 internal.
type Level
    float  price
    int    side
    int    rank
    string name
    int    t
    int    kind
    bool   consumed  = false
    int    acceptCnt = 0
    line   ln
    label  lb

// 1H PD array (FVG kind 0 / OB kind 1), real prices.
type Zone
    float top
    float bot
    int   dir
    int   kind
    int   t
    bool  tapped = false
    box   bx

// Running session high/low tracker.
type SessTrack
    float hi
    float lo
    float fhi
    float flo
    bool  wasIn = false

// One setup per direction. Prices are NORMALISED (price × direction) unless noted "real".
type Setup
    int           direction
    int           state        = 0
    // swept level
    float         level
    int           levelRank
    string        levelName    = ""
    // C1
    int           c1Bar
    int           c1Time
    float         c1High                   // real
    float         c1Low                    // real
    float         c1Ext                    // C1 extreme (low for long)
    float         seqExt                   // extreme of the whole sweep sequence
    float         c1nOpen
    float         c1nClose
    float         closePos
    float         wickBody
    int           grade                    // 3 A · 2 B · 1 C
    string        cWarn        = ""
    int           risk                     // 0 LOW · 1 MODERATE · 2 HIGH
    int           riskC1
    string        riskWhy      = ""
    bool          deeperFlag   = false
    bool          deeperIsZone = false
    float         deeperRef
    bool          intoZone     = false
    float         intoZoneBot
    float         rangePos
    bool          locOK        = false
    bool          primeAtC1    = false
    bool          openAtC1     = false
    bool          earlyHour    = false
    bool          beyondHourOpen = false
    int           htfConfirm   = -1        // −1 pending · 0 no · 1 yes
    int           acceptCnt    = 0
    bool          reclaimed    = false
    // MSS / displacement
    float         originN
    int           originBar
    int           mssType                  // 1 internal · 2 structural
    int           mssBar
    float         mssLevel
    float         mssHighN
    bool          mssIsDisp    = false
    bool          dispFvg      = false
    float         dispLowN
    float         maxRvol
    float         fvgTop
    float         fvgBot
    int           fvgBar
    int           dispStrength             // 0 WEAK · 1 MODERATE · 2 STRONG
    // second-sweep machinery (E5 + re-entry)
    bool          s2Active     = false
    bool          s2Reclaimed  = false
    float         s2Low
    int           s2Bar
    int           s2RecBar
    int           s2Accept     = 0
    float         legHigh
    float         mss2Level
    int           mss2Type
    bool          e5Done       = false
    int           reStartBar
    // plan
    int           entryModel               // 1 E1 · 2 E2 · 3 E3 · 4 E4 · 5 E5
    float         entry1
    float         entry2
    float         entry4
    float         e4Bot
    float         avgPlan
    float         stop
    float         stop0
    string        stopTxt      = ""
    float         tp1
    float         tp2
    float         runner
    float         rr
    int           score
    float         qty
    bool          starter      = false
    string        flagsAgg     = ""
    string        flagsWait    = ""
    string        note         = ""
    int           armBar
    // E3
    float         consHi
    float         consLo
    int           consBar
    float         runHigh
    // virtual trade
    int           fillBar
    bool          t1Filled     = false
    bool          t2Filled     = false
    float         posSh        = 0.0
    float         posCost      = 0.0
    float         realizedR    = 0.0
    bool          tp1Hit       = false
    bool          tp2Hit       = false
    bool          beDone       = false
    bool          lhPrinted    = false
    float         bosRefN
    float         lastTrailPL
    float         tradeHigh
    int           reentryCount = 0
    bool          isReentry    = false
    string        result       = ""
    string        lastResult   = ""
    int           endBar       = 0
    float         rStart       = 0.0      // realizedR at the start of the current trade
    int           entryWin                // session window index at fill
    float         addQty       = 0.0      // E5 add quantity (starter trades)
    float         q1           = 0.0      // tier-1 / single-entry quantity
    float         q2           = 0.0      // E2 tier-2 quantity
    array<string> events
    // drawings
    label         c1Lbl
    array<line>   lines
    array<label>  lbls
    array<box>    boxes
    line          stopLine
    label         stopLbl

// ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
// CHART GUARD, BASIC SERIES
// ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
bool  tfOK    = timeframe.period == ltfExpected
bool  sigOn   = tfOK or allowAnyTF
float tick    = syminfo.mintick
float bufPx   = bufferTicks * syminfo.mintick
int   tfMs    = timeframe.in_seconds() * 1000
bool  barGap  = not na(time[1]) and time - time[1] > 3 * tfMs

float atr5    = ta.atr(14)
float bodyAbs = math.abs(close - open)
float avgBody = ta.sma(bodyAbs, 20)
float volMA   = ta.sma(volume, 20)
bool  hasVol  = ta.cum(nz(volume)) > 0
float rvol    = hasVol and not na(volMA) and volMA > 0 ? volume / volMA : na

// consolidation helpers (E3)
float hh2 = ta.highest(high, 2)
float hh3 = ta.highest(high, 3)
float hh4 = ta.highest(high, 4)
float ll2 = ta.lowest(low, 2)
float ll3 = ta.lowest(low, 3)
float ll4 = ta.lowest(low, 4)

// 5M pivots: internal (rank-4 pools, internal MSS, trade management) and structural (MSS origin)
float iph = ta.pivothigh(high, ltfIntPivotLen, ltfIntPivotLen)
float ipl = ta.pivotlow(low, ltfIntPivotLen, ltfIntPivotLen)
float sph = ta.pivothigh(high, ltfStructPivotLen, ltfStructPivotLen)
float spl = ta.pivotlow(low, ltfStructPivotLen, ltfStructPivotLen)

var float lastIPH    = na
var float prevIPH    = na
var int   lastIPHbar = na
var float lastIPL    = na
var float prevIPL    = na
var int   lastIPLbar = na
var float lastSPH    = na
var int   lastSPHbar = na
var float lastSPL    = na
var int   lastSPLbar = na
if not na(iph)
    prevIPH    := lastIPH
    lastIPH    := iph
    lastIPHbar := bar_index - ltfIntPivotLen
if not na(ipl)
    prevIPL    := lastIPL
    lastIPL    := ipl
    lastIPLbar := bar_index - ltfIntPivotLen
if not na(sph)
    lastSPH    := sph
    lastSPHbar := bar_index - ltfStructPivotLen
if not na(spl)
    lastSPL    := spl
    lastSPLbar := bar_index - ltfStructPivotLen

// ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
// SESSIONS & TIMING
// ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
string mktTz  = preset == "US" ? "America/New_York" : preset == "PSX" ? "Asia/Karachi" : cTz
string sMain  = preset == "US" ? usMain  : preset == "PSX" ? psxMain  : cMain
string sOpen  = preset == "US" ? usOpen  : preset == "PSX" ? psxOpen  : cOpen
string sPrime = preset == "US" ? usPrime : preset == "PSX" ? psxPrime : cPrime
string sMid   = preset == "US" ? usMid   : preset == "PSX" ? psxMid   : cMid
string sAft   = preset == "US" ? usAft   : preset == "PSX" ? psxAft   : cAft

f_in(string sess, string tz) =>
    not na(time(timeframe.period, sess, tz))

f_hhmm(string sess) =>
    str.tonumber(str.substring(sess, 0, 2)) * 60 + str.tonumber(str.substring(sess, 2, 4))

bool  inMain      = f_in(sMain, mktTz)
bool  inOpen      = f_in(sOpen, mktTz)
bool  inPrime     = f_in(sPrime, mktTz)
bool  inMidday    = f_in(sMid, mktTz)
bool  inAfter     = f_in(sAft, mktTz)
bool  inAsia      = f_in(asiaSess, liqTz)
bool  inLondon    = f_in(londonSess, liqTz)
int   modMkt      = hour(time, mktTz) * 60 + minute(time, mktTz)
bool  beforePrime = inMain and not inPrime and modMkt < f_hhmm(sPrime)
string winName    = inOpen ? "Opening vol" : inPrime ? "Prime" : inMidday ? "Midday" : inAfter ? "Afternoon" : inMain ? "Late session" : "Closed"

// News blackout
var array<int> newsArr = array.new<int>()
if barstate.isfirst and str.length(newsTimes) > 0
    for p in str.split(newsTimes, ",")
        array<string> hm = str.split(str.trim(p), ":")
        if array.size(hm) == 2
            float hh = str.tonumber(array.get(hm, 0))
            float mm = str.tonumber(array.get(hm, 1))
            if not na(hh) and not na(mm)
                array.push(newsArr, int(hh * 60 + mm))
float tfMin = timeframe.in_seconds() / 60.0
bool inBlackout = false
for nm in newsArr
    if modMkt + tfMin > nm - newsMins and modMkt < nm + newsMins
        inBlackout := true

// ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
// HTF DATA — one request.security per timeframe, tuple of [1]-shifted values (non-repainting)
// ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
// Evaluated ON the HTF series. Returns the values of the last CLOSED HTF bar.
f_htf(int pl, int ml, int lb, int obLb) =>
    float ph  = ta.pivothigh(high, pl, pl)
    float plo = ta.pivotlow(low, pl, pl)
    float mph = ta.pivothigh(high, ml, ml)
    float mpl = ta.pivotlow(low, ml, ml)
    var float sh     = na
    var float sl     = na
    var int   sht    = na
    var int   slt    = na
    var bool  shUsed = true
    var bool  slUsed = true
    var int   bias   = 0
    var int   bosBar = na
    var float msh    = na
    var float msl    = na
    var int   choch  = 0
    if not na(ph)
        sh     := ph
        sht    := time[pl]
        shUsed := false
    if not na(plo)
        sl     := plo
        slt    := time[pl]
        slUsed := false
    if not na(mph)
        msh := mph
    if not na(mpl)
        msl := mpl
    // BOS = BODY close beyond the last confirmed swing (wicks do not count)
    int bos = 0
    if not shUsed and close > sh
        bias   := 1
        shUsed := true
        bos    := 1
        bosBar := bar_index
        choch  := 0
    else if not slUsed and close < sl
        bias   := -1
        slUsed := true
        bos    := -1
        bosBar := bar_index
        choch  := 0
    // CHoCH = close beyond a minor swing against the current bias (no structural BOS yet)
    if bos == 0
        if bias == -1 and not na(msh) and close > msh
            choch := 1
        else if bias == 1 and not na(msl) and close < msl
            choch := -1
    int biasOut = not na(bosBar) and bar_index - bosBar <= lb ? bias : 0
    // 1H FVG (3-candle gap)
    bool  bullF = low > high[2]
    bool  bearF = high < low[2]
    float fTop  = bullF ? low : bearF ? low[2] : na
    float fBot  = bullF ? high[2] : bearF ? high : na
    int   fDir  = bullF ? 1 : bearF ? -1 : 0
    int   fT    = time[2]
    // 1H OB = last opposite candle before the BOS displacement
    float obTop = na
    float obBot = na
    int   obT   = na
    int   obDir = 0
    if bos != 0
        for i = 1 to obLb
            bool opp = bos == 1 ? close[i] < open[i] : close[i] > open[i]
            if opp
                obTop := high[i]
                obBot := low[i]
                obT   := time[i]
                obDir := bos
                break
    float atrH = ta.atr(14)
    [biasOut[1], choch[1], bos[1], sh[1], sl[1], sht[1], slt[1], ph[1], plo[1], time[pl + 1], fTop[1], fBot[1], fDir[1], fT[1], obTop[1], obBot[1], obDir[1], obT[1], atrH[1], close[1]]

// Bias-only structure for the 4H / Daily cross-check.
f_bias(int pl, int lb) =>
    float ph  = ta.pivothigh(high, pl, pl)
    float plo = ta.pivotlow(low, pl, pl)
    var float sh     = na
    var float sl     = na
    var bool  shUsed = true
    var bool  slUsed = true
    var int   bias   = 0
    var int   bosBar = na
    if not na(ph)
        sh     := ph
        shUsed := false
    if not na(plo)
        sl     := plo
        slUsed := false
    if not shUsed and close > sh
        bias   := 1
        shUsed := true
        bosBar := bar_index
    else if not slUsed and close < sl
        bias   := -1
        slUsed := true
        bosBar := bar_index
    int b = not na(bosBar) and bar_index - bosBar <= lb ? bias : 0
    [b[1], sh[1], sl[1]]

[h_bias, h_choch, h_bos, h_SH, h_SL, h_SHt, h_SLt, h_ph, h_pl, h_pivT, h_fTop, h_fBot, h_fDir, h_fT, h_obTop, h_obBot, h_obDir, h_obT, h_atr, h_close] = request.security(syminfo.tickerid, htfTF, f_htf(htfPivotLen, htfChochLen, biasLookback, obLookback), lookahead = barmerge.lookahead_on)
[b4Bias, b4SH, b4SL] = request.security(syminfo.tickerid, biasTF, f_bias(htfPivotLen, biasLookback), lookahead = barmerge.lookahead_on)
[pdH, pdL] = request.security(syminfo.tickerid, "D", [high[1], low[1]], lookahead = barmerge.lookahead_on)
[pwH, pwL] = request.security(syminfo.tickerid, "W", [high[1], low[1]], lookahead = barmerge.lookahead_on)
string refineTF = useLTFRefine ? "1" : timeframe.period
[m1H, m1L, m1T] = request.security_lower_tf(syminfo.tickerid, refineTF, [high, low, time])

bool  htfNew      = timeframe.change(htfTF)
bool  newDay      = timeframe.change("D")
bool  newWeek     = timeframe.change("W")
bool  htfAligned  = nz(h_bias) != 0 and nz(b4Bias) == nz(h_bias)
float rHigh       = na(h_SH) or na(h_SL) ? na : math.max(h_SH, h_SL)
float rLow        = na(h_SH) or na(h_SL) ? na : math.min(h_SH, h_SL)
float rEq         = na(rHigh) ? na : (rHigh + rLow) / 2
int   hourOpenT   = time(htfTF)
float minIntoHour = na(hourOpenT) ? na : (time_close - hourOpenT) / 60000.0
bool  earlyInHour = not na(minIntoHour) and minIntoHour <= earlyMinutes
var float hourOpen = na
if htfNew
    hourOpen := open

// 1M FVG tracker for E4 (only reads 1M bars inside the closed 5M bar)
var float m1BullTop = na
var float m1BullBot = na
var int   m1BullT   = na
var float m1BearTop = na
var float m1BearBot = na
var int   m1BearT   = na
var float c1mH1 = na
var float c1mH2 = na
var float c1mL1 = na
var float c1mL2 = na
var int   c1mT1 = na
if barstate.isconfirmed and useLTFRefine
    int nm1 = array.size(m1H)
    if nm1 > 0
        for j = 0 to nm1 - 1
            float hh1 = array.get(m1H, j)
            float ll1 = array.get(m1L, j)
            int   tt1 = array.get(m1T, j)
            if not na(c1mH2) and ll1 > c1mH2
                m1BullTop := ll1
                m1BullBot := c1mH2
                m1BullT   := c1mT1
            if not na(c1mL2) and hh1 < c1mL2
                m1BearTop := c1mL2
                m1BearBot := hh1
                m1BearT   := c1mT1
            c1mH2 := c1mH1
            c1mL2 := c1mL1
            c1mH1 := hh1
            c1mL1 := ll1
            c1mT1 := tt1

// ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
// PERSISTENT STORES
// ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
int poolCap = maxZones + 10      // + 10 reserved for named key/session levels
var array<Level> pools    = array.new<Level>()    // ranks 1–3
var array<Level> intPools = array.new<Level>()    // rank 4
var array<Zone>  zones    = array.new<Zone>()
// Funnel diagnostics per direction: [C1, rejected at C1, MSS, ARMED, skipped, cancelled] × [long, short]
var array<int>    diag    = array.new<int>(12, 0)
var array<string> lastWhy = array.from("", "")
var SessTrack stAsia   = SessTrack.new()
var SessTrack stLondon = SessTrack.new()
var SessTrack stMain   = SessTrack.new()
var array<bool> blocked = array.from(false, false)
var array<bool> busy    = array.from(false, false)   // direction ARMED or in a trade (one position at a time)

// R ledger buckets: 0 all · 1–5 E1..E5 · 6–8 grade A/B/C · 9–11 risk LOW/MOD/HIGH ·
// 12–16 window Opening/Prime/Midday/Afternoon/Late · 17–18 long/short
int NB = 19
var array<float>  bN    = array.new<float>(NB, 0.0)
var array<float>  bWin  = array.new<float>(NB, 0.0)
var array<float>  bSum  = array.new<float>(NB, 0.0)
var array<float>  bGP   = array.new<float>(NB, 0.0)
var array<float>  bGL   = array.new<float>(NB, 0.0)
var array<float>  bPeak = array.from(0.0, 0.0)         // [peak cumulative R, max drawdown R]
var array<string> logTx = array.new<string>()
var array<float>  logR  = array.new<float>()
var array<float>  lastTradeR = array.from(0.0)
var array<int>    lastTradeBar = array.from(-1)

// ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
// GENERIC HELPERS
// ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
// Normalised OHLC accessors (n = price × d). For shorts the extremes swap.
f_nH(int d, int k) =>
    d == 1 ? high[k] : -low[k]
f_nL(int d, int k) =>
    d == 1 ? low[k] : -high[k]
f_nC(int d, int k) =>
    d * close[k]
f_nO(int d, int k) =>
    d * open[k]
f_hhN(int d, int n) =>
    d == 1 ? (n == 2 ? hh2 : n == 3 ? hh3 : hh4) : -(n == 2 ? ll2 : n == 3 ? ll3 : ll4)
f_llN(int d, int n) =>
    d == 1 ? (n == 2 ? ll2 : n == 3 ? ll3 : ll4) : -(n == 2 ? hh2 : n == 3 ? hh3 : hh4)

// Displacement candle (bar k): big body, closes in the top dispClosePct of its range, with the trade.
f_isDisp(int d, int k) =>
    float rng = f_nH(d, k) - f_nL(d, k)
    float cp  = rng > 0 ? (f_nC(d, k) - f_nL(d, k)) / rng : 0.0
    bool  big = not na(avgBody[k]) and bodyAbs[k] >= dispBodyMult * avgBody[k]
    big and f_nC(d, k) > f_nO(d, k) and cp >= 1 - dispClosePct / 100.0

f_fmt(float x) =>
    na(x) ? "—" : str.tostring(x, format.mintick)
f_num(float x) =>
    na(x) ? "null" : str.tostring(x, format.mintick)
f_fmtR(float r) =>
    na(r) ? "—" : (r >= 0 ? "+" : "") + str.tostring(r, "#.##") + "R"
f_gradeTxt(int g) =>
    g == 3 ? "A" : g == 2 ? "B" : g == 1 ? "C" : "—"
f_riskTxt(int r) =>
    r == 0 ? "LOW" : r == 1 ? "MOD" : r == 2 ? "HIGH" : "—"
f_dispTxt(int s) =>
    s == 2 ? "STRONG" : s == 1 ? "MODERATE" : s == 0 ? "WEAK" : "—"
f_modelShort(int m) =>
    m == 1 ? "E1" : m == 2 ? "E2" : m == 3 ? "E3" : m == 4 ? "E4" : m == 5 ? "E5" : "—"
f_biasTxt(int b) =>
    b == 1 ? "BULL" : b == -1 ? "BEAR" : "NONE"
f_stName(int st) =>
    switch st
        0  => "IDLE"
        1  => "C1_DETECTED"
        2  => "WAIT_RECLAIM"
        3  => "WAIT_MSS"
        4  => "MSS_CONFIRMED"
        5  => "WATCH_SECOND_SWEEP"
        6  => "ARMED"
        7  => "IN_TRADE"
        8  => "TRAIL"
        9  => "DONE"
        10 => "STOPPED"
        11 => "SCRATCHED"
        12 => "CANCELLED"
        13 => "SKIPPED"
        14 => "INVALID"
        15 => "REENTRY_WATCH"
        => "?"
f_isTerminal(int st) =>
    st == ST_DONE or st == ST_STOPPED or st == ST_SCRATCHED or st == ST_CANCELLED or st == ST_SKIPPED or st == ST_INVALID

// ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
// LIQUIDITY LEVELS
// ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
f_rankWidth(int r) =>
    r == 1 ? 3 : r == 2 ? 2 : 1

f_levelColor(Level lv) =>
    color base = lv.side == 1 ? colHiLiq : colLoLiq
    lv.consumed ? color.new(base, 80) : base

f_restyle(Level lv) =>
    color c = f_levelColor(lv)
    if not na(lv.ln)
        line.set_color(lv.ln, c)
        line.set_width(lv.ln, f_rankWidth(lv.rank))
        line.set_y1(lv.ln, lv.price)
        line.set_y2(lv.ln, lv.price)
    if not na(lv.lb)
        label.set_text(lv.lb, lv.name)
        label.set_textcolor(lv.lb, c)
        label.set_y(lv.lb, lv.price)
    true

f_addLevel(array<Level> arr, float p, int side, int rank, string name, int t, int kind, int cap, bool show) =>
    if not na(p)
        bool merged = false
        float tol = syminfo.mintick * 2
        // de-duplicate (keep the better rank); two key levels (kind 0) may coexist
        for lv in arr
            if not lv.consumed and lv.side == side and math.abs(lv.price - p) <= tol and not (lv.kind == 0 and kind == 0)
                if rank < lv.rank
                    lv.rank := rank
                    lv.name := name
                    lv.kind := kind
                    f_restyle(lv)
                merged := true
                break
        if not merged
            Level nl = Level.new(p, side, rank, name, t, kind)
            if show
                color c = side == 1 ? colHiLiq : colLoLiq
                nl.ln := line.new(t, p, time, p, xloc = xloc.bar_time, color = c, width = f_rankWidth(rank), style = rank == 4 ? line.style_dotted : line.style_solid)
                nl.lb := label.new(time, p, name, xloc = xloc.bar_time, style = label.style_label_left, color = color(na), textcolor = c, size = size.tiny)
            array.push(arr, nl)
            if array.size(arr) > cap
                // delete oldest consumed first, else oldest non-key, else oldest
                int idx = -1
                for [j, x] in arr
                    if x.consumed
                        idx := j
                        break
                if idx < 0
                    for [j, x] in arr
                        if x.kind != 0
                            idx := j
                            break
                Level old = array.remove(arr, math.max(idx, 0))
                line.delete(old.ln)
                label.delete(old.lb)
    true

f_removeByName(array<Level> arr, string name) =>
    int n = array.size(arr)
    if n > 0
        for i = n - 1 to 0
            Level x = array.get(arr, i)
            if x.name == name
                line.delete(x.ln)
                label.delete(x.lb)
                array.remove(arr, i)
    true

f_consume(Level lv) =>
    lv.consumed := true
    if not na(lv.ln)
        line.set_x2(lv.ln, time)
    if not na(lv.lb)
        label.set_x(lv.lb, time)
    f_restyle(lv)

// 1H swing pool with equal-highs/lows merge (within eqTol × ATR 1H)
f_add1HSwing(int side, float p, int t) =>
    bool merged = false
    float tol = eqTol * h_atr
    for lv in pools
        if not merged and not lv.consumed and lv.kind == 1 and lv.side == side and not na(tol) and math.abs(lv.price - p) <= tol
            lv.price := side == 1 ? math.max(lv.price, p) : math.min(lv.price, p)
            lv.name  := side == 1 ? "EQH" : "EQL"
            f_restyle(lv)
            merged := true
    if not merged
        f_addLevel(pools, p, side, 2, side == 1 ? "1H SH" : "1H SL", t, 1, poolCap, showLevels)
    true

// Sweep scan for direction d: consumes every swept level, returns best (lowest rank number; tie → deeper).
f_sweepScan(array<Level> arr, int d, float bestNIn, int bestRankIn, string bestNameIn) =>
    float  bestN    = bestNIn
    int    bestRank = bestRankIn
    string bestName = bestNameIn
    float  nL0 = f_nL(d, 0)
    float  nC0 = f_nC(d, 0)
    for lv in arr
        if not lv.consumed and lv.side == -d
            float n = d * lv.price
            if nL0 < n and nC0 > n
                if na(bestRank) or lv.rank < bestRank or (lv.rank == bestRank and n < bestN)
                    bestN    := n
                    bestRank := lv.rank
                    bestName := lv.name
                f_consume(lv)
    [bestN, bestRank, bestName]

// Acceptance: acceptBars consecutive closes beyond an unconsumed level → breakout, consume.
f_acceptScan(array<Level> arr) =>
    for lv in arr
        if not lv.consumed
            bool beyond = lv.side == -1 ? close < lv.price : close > lv.price
            lv.acceptCnt := beyond ? lv.acceptCnt + 1 : 0
            if lv.acceptCnt >= acceptBars
                f_consume(lv)
    true

// ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
// 1H ZONES
// ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
f_zTopN(Zone z, int d) =>
    d == 1 ? z.top : -z.bot
f_zBotN(Zone z, int d) =>
    d == 1 ? z.bot : -z.top

f_addZone(float top, float bot, int dir, int kind, int t) =>
    if not na(top) and not na(bot)
        Zone z = Zone.new(math.max(top, bot), math.min(top, bot), dir, kind, t)
        if showZones
            color c = dir == 1 ? colBull : colBear
            z.bx := box.new(t, z.top, time, z.bot, xloc = xloc.bar_time, border_color = color.new(c, 60), bgcolor = color.new(c, 88), text = kind == 0 ? "1H FVG" : "1H OB", text_color = color.new(c, 20), text_size = size.tiny, text_halign = text.align_left, text_valign = text.align_top)
        array.push(zones, z)
        if array.size(zones) > maxZones
            int idx = 0
            for [j, x] in zones
                if x.tapped
                    idx := j
                    break
            Zone old = array.remove(zones, idx)
            box.delete(old.bx)
    true

f_tapZones() =>
    for z in zones
        if not z.tapped
            bool hit = z.dir == 1 ? low <= z.top : high >= z.bot
            if hit
                z.tapped := true
                if not na(z.bx)
                    color c = z.dir == 1 ? colBull : colBear
                    box.set_right(z.bx, time)
                    box.set_bgcolor(z.bx, color.new(c, 96))
                    box.set_border_color(z.bx, color.new(c, 85))
    true

// Did the current bar trade INTO an untapped 1H zone of direction d?
f_intoZone(int d) =>
    bool  into = false
    float zb   = na
    float nL0  = f_nL(d, 0)
    float nH0  = f_nH(d, 0)
    for z in zones
        if not z.tapped and z.dir == d
            float zt  = f_zTopN(z, d)
            float zbn = f_zBotN(z, d)
            if nL0 <= zt and nH0 >= zbn
                into := true
                zb   := na(zb) ? zbn : math.min(zb, zbn)
    [into, zb]

// Deeper liquidity beyond C1 within dist: unconsumed rank 1–3 pool or untapped 1H zone.
f_deeper(int d, float nExt, float dist) =>
    bool  found  = false
    bool  isZone = false
    float ref    = na
    for lv in pools
        if not lv.consumed and lv.side == -d and lv.rank <= 3
            float n = d * lv.price
            if n < nExt and n >= nExt - dist
                found := true
                ref   := na(ref) ? n : math.min(ref, n)
    for z in zones
        if not z.tapped and z.dir == d
            float zt = f_zTopN(z, d)
            if zt < nExt and zt >= nExt - dist
                found  := true
                isZone := true
                float zb = f_zBotN(z, d)
                ref := na(ref) ? zb : math.min(ref, zb)
    [found, isZone, ref]

// Leg origin: extreme (normalised high) from fromBar to now; returns [value, bar].
f_origin(int d, int fromBar) =>
    int   n    = math.max(math.min(bar_index - fromBar, 400), 0)
    float best = na
    int   bb   = bar_index
    for i = 0 to n
        float v = f_nH(d, i)
        if na(best) or v > best
            best := v
            bb   := bar_index - i
    [best, bb]

// Targets: TP1 nearest internal liquidity, TP2 external 1H liquidity, runner 4H draw.
f_targets(int d, float entryN, float refN, float riskN) =>
    float tp1 = na
    for lv in intPools
        if not lv.consumed and lv.side == d
            float n = d * lv.price
            if n > refN and (na(tp1) or n < tp1)
                tp1 := n
    for lv in pools
        if not lv.consumed and lv.side == d and lv.kind == 1
            float n = d * lv.price
            if n > refN and (na(tp1) or n < tp1)
                tp1 := n
    if na(tp1)
        tp1 := math.max(entryN + tp1FallbackR * riskN, refN + syminfo.mintick)
    float tp2 = na
    float rH  = d == 1 ? rHigh : -rLow
    if not na(rH) and rH > tp1
        tp2 := rH
    for lv in pools
        if not lv.consumed and lv.side == d and lv.rank <= 2
            float n = d * lv.price
            if n > tp1 and (na(tp2) or n < tp2)
                tp2 := n
    float rn = na
    float b4 = d == 1 ? b4SH : -b4SL
    if useRunner and htfAligned and not na(b4) and b4 > nz(tp2, tp1)
        rn := b4
    [tp1, tp2, rn]

// ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
// SETUP HELPERS
// ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
f_newSetup(int d) =>
    Setup.new(direction = d, events = array.new<string>(), lines = array.new<line>(), lbls = array.new<label>(), boxes = array.new<box>())

f_diag(int d, int k) =>
    int idx = k * 2 + (d == 1 ? 0 : 1)
    array.set(diag, idx, array.get(diag, idx) + 1)

f_ev(Setup s, string code) =>
    int k = code == "C1" ? 0 : code == "MSS" ? 2 : code == "ARMED" ? 3 : -1
    if k >= 0
        f_diag(s.direction, k)
    array.push(s.events, code)

f_riskAmt() =>
    useFixedRisk ? fixedRisk : (sizeFromEquity ? strategy.equity : accountSize) * riskPct / 100.0

f_winIdx() =>
    inOpen ? 0 : inPrime ? 1 : inMidday ? 2 : inAfter ? 3 : 4

f_winTxt(int w) =>
    w == 0 ? "Opening" : w == 1 ? "Prime" : w == 2 ? "Midday" : w == 3 ? "Afternoon" : w == 4 ? "Late" : "—"

f_bAdd(int i, float r) =>
    array.set(bN, i, array.get(bN, i) + 1)
    array.set(bSum, i, array.get(bSum, i) + r)
    if r > 0
        array.set(bWin, i, array.get(bWin, i) + 1)
        array.set(bGP, i, array.get(bGP, i) + r)
    else
        array.set(bGL, i, array.get(bGL, i) - r)
    true

// Record one completed virtual trade in the R ledger.
f_recordTrade(Setup s) =>
    float r = s.realizedR - s.rStart
    int   d = s.direction
    array.set(lastTradeR, 0, r)
    array.set(lastTradeBar, 0, bar_index)
    if time >= statsFrom
        f_bAdd(0, r)
        int m = nz(s.entryModel)
        if m >= 1 and m <= 5
            f_bAdd(m, r)
        if nz(s.grade) >= 1
            f_bAdd(6 + 3 - s.grade, r)
        if not na(s.risk)
            f_bAdd(9 + s.risk, r)
        if not na(s.entryWin)
            f_bAdd(12 + s.entryWin, r)
        f_bAdd(d == 1 ? 17 : 18, r)
        float cum = array.get(bSum, 0)
        array.set(bPeak, 0, math.max(array.get(bPeak, 0), cum))
        array.set(bPeak, 1, math.max(array.get(bPeak, 1), array.get(bPeak, 0) - cum))
    string tag = (d == 1 ? "L " : "S ") + f_modelShort(s.entryModel) + (s.starter ? "s" : "") + (s.e5Done and s.starter ? "+E5" : "") + (s.isReentry ? "re" : "") + " · " + f_gradeTxt(s.grade) + " · " + f_riskTxt(s.risk) + " · " + f_winTxt(s.entryWin)
    array.unshift(logTx, str.format("{0,date,MM-dd HH:mm}", time) + " " + tag)
    array.unshift(logR, r)
    if array.size(logTx) > 20
        array.pop(logTx)
        array.pop(logR)
    if showTradeLabels
        label.new(bar_index, d == 1 ? high : low, f_fmtR(r) + "\n" + tag, style = d == 1 ? label.style_label_down : label.style_label_up, color = color.new(r > 0 ? colTarget : r < 0 ? colStop : colNeutral, 20), textcolor = color.white, size = size.tiny)
    true

f_avg(Setup s) =>
    s.posSh > 0 ? s.posCost / s.posSh : na

f_fill(Setup s, float pxN, float sh) =>
    s.posSh   := s.posSh + sh
    s.posCost := s.posCost + sh * pxN
    true

// Close a fraction of the open position at pxN; realised R in units of the planned risk budget.
f_exit(Setup s, float pxN, float frac) =>
    float avg = f_avg(s)
    if not na(avg)
        float shx = s.posSh * frac
        s.realizedR := s.realizedR + shx * (pxN - avg)
        s.posSh     := s.posSh - shx
        s.posCost   := s.posCost - shx * avg
        if frac >= 1.0
            f_recordTrade(s)
    true

f_resetTrade(Setup s) =>
    s.posSh       := 0.0
    s.posCost     := 0.0
    s.fillBar     := na
    s.t1Filled    := false
    s.t2Filled    := false
    s.tp1Hit      := false
    s.tp2Hit      := false
    s.beDone      := false
    s.lhPrinted   := false
    s.bosRefN     := na
    s.lastTrailPL := na
    s.tradeHigh   := na
    s.runHigh     := na
    s.rStart      := s.realizedR
    s.addQty      := 0.0
    s.entryWin    := na
    true

f_end(Setup s, int st, string why) =>
    s.state  := st
    s.endBar := bar_index
    s.result := why
    if st == ST_SKIPPED or st == ST_CANCELLED
        f_diag(s.direction, st == ST_SKIPPED ? 4 : 5)
        array.set(lastWhy, s.direction == 1 ? 0 : 1, why)
    for ln in s.lines
        if line.get_x2(ln) > bar_index
            line.set_x2(ln, bar_index)
    for lb in s.lbls
        if label.get_x(lb) > bar_index
            label.set_x(lb, bar_index)
    for bx in s.boxes
        if box.get_right(bx) > bar_index
            box.set_right(bx, bar_index)
    if st == ST_INVALID or st == ST_CANCELLED
        if not na(s.c1Lbl)
            label.set_color(s.c1Lbl, color.new(colNeutral, 40))
    true

// Keep the active plan drawings a few bars ahead of price.
f_extend(Setup s) =>
    for ln in s.lines
        if line.get_x2(ln) < bar_index + 3
            line.set_x2(ln, bar_index + 3)
    for lb in s.lbls
        if label.get_x(lb) < bar_index + 3
            label.set_x(lb, bar_index + 3)
    for bx in s.boxes
        if box.get_right(bx) < bar_index + 3
            box.set_right(bx, bar_index + 3)
    true

f_r(Setup s, float pN) =>
    float rk = s.avgPlan - s.stop0
    rk > 0 ? (pN - s.avgPlan) / rk : na

f_hline(Setup s, float pN, string txt, color c, int w, string sty) =>
    int   d  = s.direction
    float y  = d * pN
    line  ln = line.new(bar_index, y, bar_index + 20, y, color = c, width = w, style = sty)
    label lb = label.new(bar_index + 20, y, txt, style = label.style_label_left, color = color(na), textcolor = c, size = size.small)
    array.push(s.lines, ln)
    array.push(s.lbls, lb)
    ln

f_drawPlan(Setup s) =>
    if showPlans
        int d = s.direction
        if not na(s.fvgTop) and (s.entryModel == 1 or s.entryModel == 2)
            float a = d * s.fvgTop
            float b = d * s.fvgBot
            array.push(s.boxes, box.new(nz(s.fvgBar, bar_index) - 1, math.max(a, b), bar_index + 20, math.min(a, b), border_color = color.new(colEntry, 60), bgcolor = color.new(colEntry, 88), text = "5M FVG", text_size = size.tiny, text_color = colEntry, text_halign = text.align_right, text_valign = text.align_top))
        if s.entryModel == 3 and not na(s.consHi)
            float a = d * s.consHi
            float b = d * s.consLo
            array.push(s.boxes, box.new(nz(s.consBar, bar_index) - 3, math.max(a, b), bar_index + 20, math.min(a, b), border_color = color.new(colEntry, 50), bgcolor = color.new(colEntry, 92), text = "E3 cons", text_size = size.tiny, text_color = colEntry, text_halign = text.align_left, text_valign = text.align_top))
        if not na(s.entry4) and not na(s.e4Bot)
            float a = d * s.entry4
            float b = d * s.e4Bot
            array.push(s.boxes, box.new(bar_index - 3, math.max(a, b), bar_index + 20, math.min(a, b), border_color = color.new(colEntry, 40), bgcolor = color.new(colEntry, 80), text = "E4 1M", text_size = size.tiny, text_color = colEntry, text_halign = text.align_left))
            f_hline(s, s.entry4, "E4 1M " + f_fmt(d * s.entry4) + " · " + f_fmtR(f_r(s, s.entry4)), color.new(colEntry, 30), 1, line.style_dotted)
        string star = " ★"
        if s.entryModel == 1
            f_hline(s, s.entry1, (s.starter ? "E1 starter " : "E1 ") + f_fmt(d * s.entry1) + star, colEntry, 2, line.style_solid)
        else if s.entryModel == 2
            f_hline(s, s.entry1, "E2a " + str.tostring(tierPct) + "% " + f_fmt(d * s.entry1) + star, colEntry, 2, line.style_solid)
            f_hline(s, s.entry2, "E2b " + str.tostring(100 - tierPct) + "% " + f_fmt(d * s.entry2), colEntry, 2, line.style_dashed)
            if not na(s.fvgTop)
                f_hline(s, s.fvgTop, "alt E1 top " + f_fmt(d * s.fvgTop), color.new(colEntry, 40), 1, line.style_dotted)
        else
            f_hline(s, s.entry1, (s.entryModel == 3 ? "E3 " : s.isReentry ? "E5 re-entry ½R " : "E5 ") + f_fmt(d * s.entry1) + star, colEntry, 2, line.style_solid)
        if showTradeBoxes
            float fin = na(s.tp2) ? s.tp1 : s.tp2
            float ye  = d * s.avgPlan
            float ys  = d * s.stop0
            float yt  = d * fin
            string bt = f_modelShort(s.entryModel) + (s.starter ? " starter" : "") + " · R:R " + (na(s.rr) ? "—" : str.tostring(s.rr, "#.#")) + " · score " + str.tostring(s.score) + "/7"
            array.push(s.boxes, box.new(bar_index, math.max(ye, yt), bar_index + 20, math.min(ye, yt), border_color = color.new(colTarget, 50), bgcolor = color.new(colTarget, 80), text = bt, text_size = size.small, text_color = color.new(colTarget, 0), text_halign = text.align_left, text_valign = d == 1 ? text.align_top : text.align_bottom))
            array.push(s.boxes, box.new(bar_index, math.max(ye, ys), bar_index + 20, math.min(ye, ys), border_color = color.new(colStop, 50), bgcolor = color.new(colStop, 80), text = "−1R", text_size = size.small, text_color = color.new(colStop, 0), text_halign = text.align_left, text_valign = d == 1 ? text.align_bottom : text.align_top))
        line sl = f_hline(s, s.stop, "SL " + f_fmt(d * s.stop) + " · −1R (" + s.stopTxt + ")", colStop, 2, line.style_solid)
        s.stopLine := sl
        s.stopLbl  := array.last(s.lbls)
        f_hline(s, s.tp1, "TP1 " + f_fmt(d * s.tp1) + " · " + f_fmtR(f_r(s, s.tp1)) + " (" + str.tostring(tp1Pct) + "%)", colTarget, 1, line.style_solid)
        if not na(s.tp2)
            f_hline(s, s.tp2, "TP2 " + f_fmt(d * s.tp2) + " · " + f_fmtR(f_r(s, s.tp2)), colTarget, 2, line.style_solid)
        if not na(s.runner)
            f_hline(s, s.runner, "Runner (4H DOL) " + f_fmt(d * s.runner) + " · " + f_fmtR(f_r(s, s.runner)), colTarget, 1, line.style_dotted)
    true

f_updStopLine(Setup s) =>
    if not na(s.stopLine)
        float y = s.direction * s.stop
        line.set_y1(s.stopLine, y)
        line.set_y2(s.stopLine, y)
        if not na(s.stopLbl)
            label.set_y(s.stopLbl, y)
            label.set_text(s.stopLbl, "SL " + f_fmt(y) + (s.beDone ? " · BE/trail" : " · −1R"))
    true

f_drawC1(Setup s) =>
    int   d   = s.direction
    color c   = s.grade == 3 ? colA : s.grade == 2 ? colB : colC
    string tx = "C1 " + f_gradeTxt(s.grade) + " · " + s.levelName + "\n2nd-sweep risk: " + f_riskTxt(s.risk) + (s.grade == 1 and s.cWarn != "" ? "\n⚠ " + s.cWarn : "")
    s.c1Lbl := label.new(bar_index, d == 1 ? low : high, tx, style = d == 1 ? label.style_label_up : label.style_label_down, color = c, textcolor = color.white, size = size.small)
    true

f_drawMSS(Setup s, float lvlN, int fromBar, bool structural) =>
    int   d = s.direction
    color c = d == 1 ? colBull : colBear
    float y = d * lvlN
    line.new(nz(fromBar, bar_index - 1), y, bar_index, y, color = c, width = 1, style = structural ? line.style_solid : line.style_dashed)
    label.new(bar_index, y, structural ? "MSS" : "iMSS", style = d == 1 ? label.style_label_lower_left : label.style_label_upper_left, color = color(na), textcolor = c, size = size.small)
    true

// ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
// PLAN: targets → R:R → score → gates → ARMED / SKIPPED (Steps 2d, 6, 7, checklist)
// ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
f_plan(Setup s, int model, float e1, float e2, float stopN, string stopTxt, bool keepTargets, bool isReentry, bool commitOnFail) =>
    int   d     = s.direction
    float nC0   = f_nC(d, 0)
    float tpf   = tierPct / 100.0
    float avg   = model == 2 ? e1 * tpf + e2 * (1 - tpf) : e1
    float riskN = avg - stopN
    bool  okStop = not na(riskN) and riskN > 0
    float t1 = s.tp1
    float t2 = s.tp2
    float rn = s.runner
    if not keepTargets and okStop
        [a1, a2, a3] = f_targets(d, avg, math.max(avg, nC0), riskN)
        t1 := a1
        t2 := a2
        rn := a3
    float fin = na(t2) ? t1 : t2
    float rr  = okStop and not na(fin) ? (fin - avg) / riskN : na
    // ── quality score 0–7
    bool isE5 = model == 5
    int  mt   = isE5 ? s.mss2Type : s.mssType
    int  sc   = (htfAligned ? 1 : 0) + (s.levelRank <= 2 ? 1 : 0) + (s.intoZone ? 1 : 0) + (s.grade == 3 ? 1 : 0) + (mt == 2 ? 1 : 0) + (s.primeAtC1 ? 1 : 0) + ((s.risk == 0 or isE5) ? 1 : 0)
    float smult = sc >= 6 ? 1.0 : sc >= 4 ? 0.5 : 0.0
    // ── chase check (≥ 50% of the way from the sweep low to TP1 already covered)
    bool  market = model == 2 or model == 3 or model == 5
    float cov    = not na(t1) and t1 > s.seqExt ? (nC0 - s.seqExt) / (t1 - s.seqExt) : na
    bool  chase  = not na(cov) and cov >= 0.5
    // ── gates
    string why = ""
    if not (h_bias == d or (allowReversals and h_choch == d))
        why := why + "1H bias · "
    if not s.locOK
        why := why + "not in " + (d == 1 ? "discount" : "premium") + " · "
    if not okStop
        why := why + "invalid stop · "
    if na(rr) or rr < minRR
        why := why + "R:R " + (na(rr) ? "n/a" : str.tostring(rr, "#.##")) + " < " + str.tostring(minRR) + " · "
    if inBlackout
        why := why + "news blackout · "
    if middayMode == "Skip" and inMidday
        why := why + "midday skip · "
    if not inMain
        why := why + "outside session · "
    if array.get(blocked, d == 1 ? 0 : 1)
        why := why + "direction invalidated today · "
    if market and chase
        why := why + "≥50% to TP1 covered · "
    if smult == 0
        why := why + "score " + str.tostring(sc) + " · "
    if array.get(busy, d == 1 ? 1 : 0)
        why := why + "opposite position open · "
    bool pass = why == ""
    // ── flags
    bool rvolHigh = not na(s.maxRvol) and s.maxRvol >= rvolMin
    float r2 = okStop and not na(t2) ? (t2 - avg) / riskN : na
    bool tgtClose = not na(r2) and r2 >= minRR and r2 <= 4.0
    string agg = (inPrime ? "PRIME " : "") + (s.dispFvg ? "DISP " : "") + (rvolHigh ? "RVOL " : "") + (tgtClose ? "1H-TGT " : "") + (s.intoZone ? "HTF-ZONE" : "")
    string wt  = (s.dispStrength == 0 ? "WEAK " : "") + (chase ? "CHASE≥50% " : "") + (not na(rr) and rr < minRR ? "RR<min" : "")
    if pass or commitOnFail
        s.entryModel := model
        s.entry1     := e1
        s.entry2     := e2
        s.avgPlan    := avg
        s.stop       := stopN
        s.stop0      := stopN
        s.stopTxt    := stopTxt
        s.tp1        := t1
        s.tp2        := t2
        s.runner     := rn
        s.rr         := rr
        s.score      := sc
        s.flagsAgg   := agg
        s.flagsWait  := wt
        s.isReentry  := isReentry
        float riskAmt = f_riskAmt()
        float mult    = smult * (s.starter ? starterPct / 100.0 : 1.0) * ((middayMode == "Reduce 50%" and inMidday) ? 0.5 : 1.0) * (isReentry ? 0.5 : 1.0)
        float rawQ    = okStop ? riskAmt * mult / riskN : 0.0
        s.qty := math.floor(rawQ / lotSize) * lotSize
        s.q1  := model == 2 ? math.floor(s.qty * tpf / lotSize) * lotSize : s.qty
        s.q2  := model == 2 ? s.qty - s.q1 : 0.0
        if pass
            f_resetTrade(s)
            s.state  := ST_ARMED
            s.armBar := bar_index
            f_ev(s, "ARMED")
            if isE5
                f_ev(s, isReentry ? "REENTRY" : "E5")
            f_drawPlan(s)
            if market
                float baseSh = 1.0 / riskN
                f_fill(s, e1, model == 2 ? baseSh * tpf : baseSh * (isReentry ? 0.5 : 1.0))
                s.t1Filled  := true
                s.fillBar   := bar_index
                s.entryWin  := f_winIdx()
                s.tradeHigh := f_nH(d, 0)
                s.state     := ST_INTRADE
                f_ev(s, "ENTRY")
        else
            f_end(s, ST_SKIPPED, "Skipped — " + (smult == 0 ? "score " + str.tostring(sc) : why))
            if showPlans
                label.new(bar_index, d == 1 ? low : high, "Skipped — score " + str.tostring(sc) + "\n" + why, style = d == 1 ? label.style_label_up : label.style_label_down, color = color.new(colNeutral, 70), textcolor = color.new(chart.fg_color, 40), size = size.tiny)
    pass

// Stop price by mode (normalised).
f_stopFor(Setup s, string mode) =>
    float sweep = s.seqExt - bufPx
    float res   = sweep
    if mode == "Structural"
        float ref    = s.seqExt
        bool  hasRef = false
        if s.deeperFlag and not na(s.deeperRef)
            ref    := math.min(ref, s.deeperRef)
            hasRef := true
        if s.intoZone and not na(s.intoZoneBot)
            ref    := math.min(ref, s.intoZoneBot)
            hasRef := true
        res := hasRef ? ref - bufPx : s.seqExt - bufPx - structPadATR * atr5
    else if mode == "Aggressive"
        float a = not na(s.dispLowN) ? s.dispLowN : s.fvgBot
        res := na(a) ? sweep : a - bufPx
    res

// MSS confirmed (+FVG known) → displacement strength → decision table → plan.
f_finalize(Setup s) =>
    int   d   = s.direction
    float nC0 = f_nC(d, 0)
    if s.mssType == 1
        s.risk := math.min(s.risk + 1, 2)      // internal MSS is weak: raise 2nd-sweep risk one level
    bool hasF = not na(s.fvgTop)
    s.dispStrength := (s.mssType == 2 and s.dispFvg and inPrime) ? 2 : (s.mssType == 2 and hasF) ? 1 : 0
    if s.risk == 2 or s.dispStrength == 0
        s.state := ST_WATCH2
        s.note  := s.risk == 2 ? "risk HIGH → wait for E5" : "WEAK displacement → wait for E5"
    else
        s.starter := s.risk == 1
        int   model = (s.dispStrength == 2 and s.risk == 0) ? 2 : 1
        float e1    = model == 2 ? nC0 : (s.dispStrength == 2 or e1ModEdge == "Top edge") ? s.fvgTop : (s.fvgTop + s.fvgBot) / 2
        float e2    = model == 2 ? s.fvgTop : na
        if useLTFRefine
            float t4 = d == 1 ? m1BullTop : -m1BearBot
            float b4 = d == 1 ? m1BullBot : -m1BearTop
            int   tt = d == 1 ? m1BullT : m1BearT
            if not na(t4) and not na(tt) and tt >= s.c1Time and t4 <= nC0 and b4 >= s.seqExt
                s.entry4 := t4
                s.e4Bot  := b4
        string mode = stopMode
        if mode == "Auto"
            mode := (s.risk >= 1 or s.deeperFlag) ? "Structural" : s.grade == 3 ? "Sweep low" : (model == 2 and s.dispStrength == 2) ? "Aggressive" : "Sweep low"
        if s.deeperFlag and mode != "Structural"
            mode := "Structural"
        f_plan(s, model, e1, e2, f_stopFor(s, mode), mode, false, false, true)
    true

// ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
// SECOND-SWEEP ENGINE (E5, starter add, re-entry). Returns 1 = 2nd MSS, −1 = accepted, −2 = 3rd sweep.
// ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
f_secondSweepStep(Setup s) =>
    int   d   = s.direction
    float nL0 = f_nL(d, 0)
    float nH0 = f_nH(d, 0)
    float nC0 = f_nC(d, 0)
    float tol = eqTol * atr5
    int   res = 0
    if not s.s2Active
        bool bounced = bar_index - s.c1Bar >= 2 and s.legHigh - s.seqExt >= minBounceATR * atr5
        if bounced and nL0 <= s.seqExt + tol
            s.s2Active  := true
            s.s2Low     := nL0
            s.s2Bar     := bar_index
            s.mss2Level := s.legHigh
            s.s2Accept  := 0
            if nC0 > s.seqExt
                s.s2Reclaimed := true
                s.s2RecBar    := bar_index
            else
                s.s2Accept := 1
        else if nL0 < s.seqExt
            // no bounce yet: the sequence simply extends
            s.seqExt  := nL0
            s.legHigh := nH0
        else
            s.legHigh := math.max(nz(s.legHigh, nH0), nH0)
    else
        if not s.s2Reclaimed
            if nL0 < s.s2Low
                s.s2Low := nL0
                s.s2Bar := bar_index
            if nC0 > s.seqExt
                s.s2Reclaimed := true
                s.s2RecBar    := bar_index
            else
                s.s2Accept := s.s2Accept + 1
                if s.s2Accept >= acceptBars
                    res := -1
        else if bar_index > s.s2RecBar and nL0 < s.s2Low
            res := -2
    if res == 0 and s.s2Active and s.s2Reclaimed
        float ip  = d == 1 ? lastIPH : -lastIPL
        int   ipb = d == 1 ? lastIPHbar : lastIPLbar
        if not na(s.mss2Level) and nC0 > s.mss2Level
            s.mss2Type := 2
            res := 1
        else if not na(ipb) and ipb > s.s2Bar and not na(ip) and nC0 > ip and f_nC(d, 1) <= ip
            s.mss2Type  := 1
            s.mss2Level := ip
            res := 1
    res

f_invalid(Setup s, string why) =>
    if s.state == ST_INTRADE or s.state == ST_TRAIL
        f_exit(s, f_nC(s.direction, 0), 1.0)
    f_ev(s, "INVALID")
    array.set(blocked, s.direction == 1 ? 0 : 1, true)
    f_end(s, ST_INVALID, "INVALID — " + why + (s.realizedR != 0 ? " " + f_fmtR(s.realizedR) : ""))

f_stopOut(Setup s, float nL0) =>
    int  d    = s.direction
    bool reEl = reentryOn and s.reentryCount == 0 and not s.tp1Hit and nL0 < s.seqExt and nL0 >= s.seqExt - deepZoneATR * atr5
    string why = s.tp1Hit ? "Stopped (trail/BE)" : s.beDone ? "Stopped at BE" : "Stopped"
    f_ev(s, "EXIT")
    f_end(s, ST_STOPPED, why + " " + f_fmtR(s.realizedR))
    if reEl
        float ip  = d == 1 ? lastIPH : -lastIPL
        int   ipb = d == 1 ? lastIPHbar : lastIPLbar
        s.state       := ST_REWATCH
        s.reStartBar  := bar_index
        s.s2Active    := true
        s.s2Reclaimed := false
        s.s2Low       := nL0
        s.s2Bar       := bar_index
        s.s2Accept    := 1
        s.mss2Level   := not na(ipb) and not na(s.fillBar) and ipb >= s.fillBar ? ip : s.tradeHigh
        if f_nC(d, 0) > s.seqExt
            s.s2Reclaimed := true
            s.s2RecBar    := bar_index
            s.s2Accept    := 0
    true

// ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
// STATE STEPS
// ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
// Leg tracking after C1: displacement candles, first/displacement FVG, RVOL.
f_trackLeg(Setup s) =>
    int   d   = s.direction
    float nL0 = f_nL(d, 0)
    if not na(rvol)
        s.maxRvol := math.max(nz(s.maxRvol), rvol)
    if bar_index - 2 >= s.c1Bar and nL0 > f_nH(d, 2)
        bool dm = f_isDisp(d, 1)
        if na(s.fvgTop) or (dm and not s.dispFvg)
            s.fvgTop := nL0
            s.fvgBot := f_nH(d, 2)
            s.fvgBar := bar_index - 1
            if dm
                s.dispFvg  := true
                s.dispLowN := f_nL(d, 1)
    true

// WAIT_MSS / WAIT_RECLAIM / MSS_CONFIRMED
f_stepPre(Setup s) =>
    int   d    = s.direction
    float nL0  = f_nL(d, 0)
    float nH0  = f_nH(d, 0)
    float nC0  = f_nC(d, 0)
    int   k    = bar_index - s.c1Bar
    bool  done = false
    // acceptance below the swept level → breakout
    s.acceptCnt := nC0 < s.level ? s.acceptCnt + 1 : 0
    if s.acceptCnt >= acceptBars
        f_end(s, ST_CANCELLED, "Acceptance beyond " + s.levelName + " → breakout")
        done := true
    // C1 extreme taken before the setup completes → hand over to the E5 engine
    if not done and s.state != ST_WAIT_REC and nL0 < s.c1Ext
        s.state := ST_WATCH2
        s.note  := "C1 extreme taken before entry → E5 watch"
        f_secondSweepStep(s)
        done := true
    if not done and s.state == ST_WAIT_REC
        s.seqExt := math.min(s.seqExt, nL0)
    if not done
        f_trackLeg(s)
        if s.state == ST_WAIT_REC and not s.reclaimed
            if nC0 > (s.c1nOpen + s.c1nClose) / 2 or nC0 > s.c1nOpen
                s.reclaimed := true
                f_ev(s, "RECLAIM")
            else if k >= reclaimBars
                f_end(s, ST_CANCELLED, "C grade: no reclaim within " + str.tostring(reclaimBars) + " bars")
                done := true
    if not done and (s.state == ST_WAIT_MSS or (s.state == ST_WAIT_REC and s.reclaimed))
        int   t   = 0
        float lvl = na
        int   fb  = na
        if nC0 > s.originN
            t   := 2
            lvl := s.originN
            fb  := s.originBar
        else
            float ip  = d == 1 ? lastIPH : -lastIPL
            int   ipb = d == 1 ? lastIPHbar : lastIPLbar
            if not na(ip) and not na(ipb) and ipb >= s.originBar and nC0 > ip and f_nC(d, 1) <= ip
                t   := 1
                lvl := ip
                fb  := ipb
        if t > 0
            s.mssType   := t
            s.mssBar    := bar_index
            s.mssLevel  := lvl
            s.mssHighN  := nH0
            s.mssIsDisp := f_isDisp(d, 0)
            s.state     := ST_MSS
            f_ev(s, "MSS")
            f_drawMSS(s, lvl, fb, t == 2)
        else if k >= mssWindow
            if s.risk >= 1
                s.state := ST_WATCH2
                s.note  := "no MSS in window → E5 watch"
            else
                f_end(s, ST_CANCELLED, "No MSS within " + str.tostring(mssWindow) + " bars")
            done := true
    if not done and s.state == ST_MSS
        // finalise when the displacement FVG is known, or after fvgWaitBars
        bool ready = s.dispFvg or bar_index - s.mssBar >= fvgWaitBars or (not na(s.fvgTop) and not s.mssIsDisp)
        if ready
            f_finalize(s)
            done := true
    if not done
        s.legHigh := math.max(nz(s.legHigh, nH0), nH0)
    true

f_stepWatch2(Setup s) =>
    int   d    = s.direction
    float nC0  = f_nC(d, 0)
    bool  done = false
    if not s.s2Active
        s.acceptCnt := nC0 < s.level ? s.acceptCnt + 1 : 0
        if s.acceptCnt >= acceptBars
            f_end(s, ST_CANCELLED, "Acceptance beyond " + s.levelName + " → breakout")
            done := true
    if not done
        int r = f_secondSweepStep(s)
        if r == -1
            f_end(s, ST_CANCELLED, "Second sweep accepted (breakout)")
        else if r == -2
            f_invalid(s, "third sweep")
        else if r == 1
            f_ev(s, "MSS")
            f_drawMSS(s, s.mss2Level, s.s2Bar, s.mss2Type == 2)
            s.starter := false
            f_plan(s, 5, nC0, na, s.s2Low - bufPx, "below 2nd sweep low", false, false, true)
        else if bar_index - s.c1Bar > secondSweepBars
            f_end(s, ST_CANCELLED, "E5 window expired")
    true

f_stepArmed(Setup s) =>
    int   d    = s.direction
    float nL0  = f_nL(d, 0)
    float nH0  = f_nH(d, 0)
    float nC0  = f_nC(d, 0)
    bool  done = false
    s.legHigh := math.max(nz(s.legHigh, nH0), nH0)
    if barGap or not inMain
        f_end(s, ST_CANCELLED, "Limit not filled (session ended)")
        done := true
    if not done and bar_index > s.armBar and nL0 <= s.entry1
        float sh = (s.starter ? starterPct / 100.0 : 1.0) / (s.entry1 - s.stop0)
        f_fill(s, s.entry1, sh)
        s.t1Filled  := true
        s.fillBar   := bar_index
        s.entryWin  := f_winIdx()
        s.tradeHigh := nH0
        s.state     := ST_INTRADE
        f_ev(s, "ENTRY")
        if nL0 <= s.stop
            f_exit(s, s.stop, 1.0)
            f_stopOut(s, nL0)
        done := true
    if not done and bar_index - s.armBar > armedExpiry
        f_end(s, ST_CANCELLED, "Limit not filled (expired)")
        done := true
    // E3 continuation: FVG left unfilled, price ran, 2–4 bar consolidation or breakaway FVG
    if not done and useE3 and not s.starter
        s.runHigh := math.max(nz(s.runHigh, nH0), nH0)
        bool ran = s.runHigh > s.mssHighN
        if ran
            bool  trig = false
            float e3St = na
            if not na(s.consHi) and bar_index > s.consBar and nC0 > s.consHi
                trig := true
                e3St := s.consLo - bufPx
            else if bar_index - 2 > s.armBar and nL0 > f_nH(d, 2) and f_nH(d, 2) > s.fvgTop
                trig := true
                e3St := f_nL(d, 2) - bufPx
            if trig
                bool ok = f_plan(s, 3, nC0, na, e3St, "E3 cons/breakaway low", false, false, false)
                if not ok
                    s.consHi := na
                    s.consLo := na
                done := true
            if not done
                for n = 4 to 2
                    float hi = f_hhN(d, n)
                    float lo = f_llN(d, n)
                    if bar_index - n + 1 > s.armBar and hi - lo <= consATR * atr5 and lo > s.fvgTop
                        s.consHi  := hi
                        s.consLo  := lo
                        s.consBar := bar_index
                        break
    if s.state == ST_ARMED
        f_extend(s)
    true

f_stepTrade(Setup s) =>
    int   d     = s.direction
    float nL0   = f_nL(d, 0)
    float nH0   = f_nH(d, 0)
    float nC0   = f_nC(d, 0)
    bool  fresh = s.fillBar == bar_index
    bool  done  = false
    if not fresh
        // E2 tier-2 limit at the FVG top edge (combined stop, shared risk budget)
        if s.entryModel == 2 and not s.t2Filled and not s.tp1Hit and nL0 <= s.entry2
            f_fill(s, s.entry2, (1.0 / (s.avgPlan - s.stop0)) * (1 - tierPct / 100.0))
            s.t2Filled := true
            f_ev(s, "ENTRY")
        if nL0 <= s.stop
            f_exit(s, s.stop, 1.0)
            f_stopOut(s, nL0)
            done := true
    if not done and not fresh
        s.tradeHigh := math.max(nz(s.tradeHigh, nH0), nH0)
        if not s.tp1Hit and nH0 >= s.tp1
            s.tp1Hit := true
            f_ev(s, "TP1")
            if na(s.tp2)
                f_exit(s, s.tp1, 1.0)
                f_ev(s, "EXIT")
                f_end(s, ST_DONE, "TP1 (final) " + f_fmtR(s.realizedR))
                done := true
            else
                f_exit(s, s.tp1, tp1Pct / 100.0)
                s.state := ST_TRAIL
                if not s.beDone
                    s.beDone := true
                    s.stop   := math.max(s.stop, f_avg(s))
                    f_ev(s, "BE")
    if not done and not fresh and s.tp1Hit and not s.tp2Hit and not na(s.tp2) and nH0 >= s.tp2
        s.tp2Hit := true
        f_ev(s, "TP2")
        if not na(s.runner)
            f_exit(s, s.tp2, 0.5)
        else
            f_exit(s, s.tp2, 1.0)
            f_end(s, ST_DONE, "TP2 " + f_fmtR(s.realizedR))
            done := true
    if not done and not fresh and s.tp2Hit and not na(s.runner) and nH0 >= s.runner
        f_exit(s, s.runner, 1.0)
        f_ev(s, "TP2")
        f_end(s, ST_DONE, "Runner " + f_fmtR(s.realizedR))
        done := true
    if not done
        // newly confirmed internal swings (normalised): swing high = iph (long) / ipl (short)
        float nPH    = d == 1 ? iph : -ipl
        float nPL    = d == 1 ? ipl : -iph
        float prevPH = d == 1 ? prevIPH : -prevIPL
        int   pBar   = bar_index - ltfIntPivotLen
        if not na(nPH) and pBar >= s.fillBar
            if not na(prevPH) and nPH < prevPH
                s.lhPrinted := true
            s.bosRefN := nPH
        // trail under each new confirmed higher low after TP1
        if not na(nPL) and s.tp1Hit and pBar >= s.fillBar
            float cand = nPL - bufPx
            if cand > s.stop and (na(s.lastTrailPL) or nPL > s.lastTrailPL)
                s.stop        := cand
                s.lastTrailPL := nPL
                f_ev(s, "TRAIL")
        // BE after a fresh 5M BOS in the trade direction
        if not s.beDone and not fresh and not na(s.bosRefN) and nC0 > s.bosRefN
            s.beDone := true
            s.stop   := math.max(s.stop, f_avg(s))
            f_ev(s, "BE")
        // time stop: TP1 not hit within timeStopBars and a lower high printed
        if not s.tp1Hit and not fresh and bar_index - s.fillBar >= timeStopBars and s.lhPrinted
            f_exit(s, nC0, 1.0)
            f_ev(s, "TIMESTOP")
            f_end(s, ST_SCRATCHED, "Time stop — scratch " + f_fmtR(s.realizedR))
            done := true
    // MODERATE-risk starter: add the main size on the E5 second-sweep reclaim
    if not done and s.starter and not s.e5Done and not s.tp1Hit and not fresh
        int r = f_secondSweepStep(s)
        if r == 1
            float stA = s.s2Low - bufPx
            float rk  = nC0 - stA
            if rk > 0
                f_fill(s, nC0, (1 - starterPct / 100.0) / rk)
                s.stop   := math.max(s.stop, stA)
                s.e5Done := true
                s.addQty := math.floor(f_riskAmt() * (1 - starterPct / 100.0) / rk / lotSize) * lotSize
                s.qty    := s.qty + s.addQty
                f_ev(s, "E5")
                f_ev(s, "ENTRY")
                f_drawMSS(s, s.mss2Level, s.s2Bar, s.mss2Type == 2)
                if showPlans
                    f_hline(s, nC0, "E5 add (main size) " + f_fmt(d * nC0), colEntry, 2, line.style_solid)
        else if r != 0
            s.e5Done := true
    if not done
        f_updStopLine(s)
        f_extend(s)
    true

f_stepRewatch(Setup s) =>
    int   d   = s.direction
    float nC0 = f_nC(d, 0)
    int   r   = f_secondSweepStep(s)
    if r == -1
        f_end(s, ST_STOPPED, s.result + " · no re-entry")
    else if r == -2
        f_invalid(s, "third sweep")
    else if r == 1
        s.reentryCount := 1
        s.starter      := false
        f_ev(s, "MSS")
        f_drawMSS(s, s.mss2Level, s.s2Bar, s.mss2Type == 2)
        f_plan(s, 5, nC0, na, s.s2Low - bufPx, "below new low", true, true, true)
    else if bar_index - s.reStartBar > secondSweepBars
        f_end(s, ST_STOPPED, s.result + " · no re-entry")
    true

// Hard invalidation + "1H confirm" on each new HTF bar (values of the just-closed 1H candle).
f_htfCheck(Setup s) =>
    int d = s.direction
    if s.htfConfirm == -1 and bar_index > s.c1Bar
        s.htfConfirm := d * h_close > s.level ? 1 : 0
    float ext = s.s2Active ? math.min(s.seqExt, s.s2Low) : s.seqExt
    if h_bos == -d
        f_invalid(s, "1H BOS against")
    else if not na(h_close) and d * h_close < ext
        f_invalid(s, "1H close beyond swept zone")
    true

// New C1 on a swept level: grade (Step 3), location (2a/2c), risk (Step 4), routing.
f_tryC1(Setup s, float lvlN, int rank, string name) =>
    int   d   = s.direction
    float nH0 = f_nH(d, 0)
    float nL0 = f_nL(d, 0)
    float nC0 = f_nC(d, 0)
    float nO0 = f_nO(d, 0)
    float rLowN  = d == 1 ? rLow : -rHigh
    float rHighN = d == 1 ? rHigh : -rLow
    float span   = rHighN - rLowN
    float pos    = not na(span) and span > 0 ? (nL0 - rLowN) / span : na
    bool  locOK  = not na(pos) and pos <= discountMax
    bool  biasOK = h_bias == d or (allowReversals and h_choch == d)
    [into, intoBot] = f_intoZone(d)
    bool  rankOK = rank <= 3 or (allowRank4Zone and into)
    bool  blk    = array.get(blocked, d == 1 ? 0 : 1)
    string why = (biasOK ? "" : "bias ") + (locOK ? "" : "location ") + (rankOK ? "" : "rank4-only ") + (inMain ? "" : "session ") + (blk ? "invalidated-today" : "")
    if sigOn and why == ""
        s.state      := ST_C1
        s.level      := lvlN
        s.levelRank  := rank
        s.levelName  := name
        s.c1Bar      := bar_index
        s.c1Time     := time
        s.c1High     := high
        s.c1Low      := low
        s.c1Ext      := nL0
        s.seqExt     := nL0
        s.c1nOpen    := nO0
        s.c1nClose   := nC0
        s.legHigh    := nH0
        s.rangePos   := pos
        s.locOK      := locOK
        s.intoZone   := into
        s.intoZoneBot := intoBot
        // grade
        float rng   = nH0 - nL0
        float cp    = rng > 0 ? (nC0 - nL0) / rng : 0.5
        bool  green = nC0 > nO0
        bool  doji  = rng > 0 and bodyAbs < dojiPct * rng
        int   g     = doji ? 2 : (cp >= 0.66 and green) ? 3 : (cp < 0.33 and not green) ? 1 : 2
        s.grade    := g
        s.closePos := cp
        float wickBeyond = lvlN - nL0
        s.wickBody := wickBeyond / math.max(bodyAbs, syminfo.mintick)
        if g == 1
            float bRel = not na(avgBody) and avgBody > 0 ? bodyAbs / avgBody : na
            string w = ""
            if not na(bRel) and bRel > 1
                w := w + "big body "
            if wickBeyond < 0.25 * rng
                w := w + "short wick "
            if nC0 - lvlN <= nearTicks * syminfo.mintick
                w := w + "close at level"
            s.cWarn := w
        // second-sweep risk factors
        [dFound, dZone, dRef] = f_deeper(d, nL0, deepZoneATR * atr5)
        s.deeperFlag   := dFound
        s.deeperIsZone := dZone
        s.deeperRef    := dRef
        bool fTiming = inOpen or beforePrime
        int  f = (dFound ? 1 : 0) + (rank >= 3 ? 1 : 0) + (fTiming ? 1 : 0) + (htfAligned ? 0 : 1)
        int  r = f == 0 ? 0 : f == 1 ? (dZone ? 2 : 1) : 2
        s.risk    := r
        s.riskC1  := r
        s.riskWhy := (dFound ? (dZone ? "deeper 1H zone " : "deeper pool ") : "") + (rank >= 3 ? "rank" + str.tostring(rank) + " " : "") + (fTiming ? "early " : "") + (htfAligned ? "" : "unaligned")
        s.primeAtC1      := inPrime
        s.openAtC1       := inOpen
        s.earlyHour      := earlyInHour
        s.beyondHourOpen := not na(hourOpen) and nL0 < d * hourOpen
        // leg origin for the structural MSS
        int fromBar = d == 1 ? nz(lastSPLbar, bar_index - 50) : nz(lastSPHbar, bar_index - 50)
        [o, ob] = f_origin(d, fromBar)
        s.originN   := o
        s.originBar := ob
        f_ev(s, "C1")
        f_drawC1(s)
        if r == 2
            s.state := ST_WATCH2
            s.note  := "risk HIGH → skip C1, watch E5"
        else if g == 1
            s.state := ST_WAIT_REC
        else
            s.state := ST_WAIT_MSS
    else if sigOn
        f_diag(d, 1)
        if rank <= 3
            array.set(lastWhy, d == 1 ? 0 : 1, "C1 rejected (" + name + "): " + why)
    if sigOn and why != "" and showRejected
        label.new(bar_index, d == 1 ? low : high, "×", tooltip = "Sweep of " + name + " rejected: " + why, style = d == 1 ? label.style_label_up : label.style_label_down, color = color(na), textcolor = colNeutral, size = size.tiny)
    true

// End-of-session housekeeping: the model is intraday — flatten / cancel on the last regular bar.
f_eod(Setup s) =>
    int st = s.state
    if st == ST_INTRADE or st == ST_TRAIL
        f_exit(s, f_nC(s.direction, 0), 1.0)
        f_ev(s, "EXIT")
        f_end(s, ST_DONE, "EOD flat " + f_fmtR(s.realizedR))
    else if st == ST_REWATCH
        f_end(s, ST_STOPPED, s.result + " · no re-entry (EOD)")
    else if st != ST_IDLE and not f_isTerminal(st)
        f_end(s, ST_CANCELLED, "Session ended")
    true

// Session high/low tracker; returns true on the bar where the session has just ended.
f_sessStep(SessTrack st, bool inS) =>
    bool ended = st.wasIn and (not inS or barGap)
    if ended
        st.fhi := st.hi
        st.flo := st.lo
        st.hi  := na
        st.lo  := na
    if inS
        st.hi := na(st.hi) ? high : math.max(st.hi, high)
        st.lo := na(st.lo) ? low : math.min(st.lo, low)
    st.wasIn := inS
    ended

// ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
// MAIN ENGINE — confirmed bars only
// ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
var array<Setup> setups = array.from(f_newSetup(1), f_newSetup(-1))

if barstate.isconfirmed
    // ── session resets
    if newDay
        array.set(blocked, 0, false)
        array.set(blocked, 1, false)
    // ── rank 1: previous day / week
    if usePDWL and newDay
        f_removeByName(pools, "PDH")
        f_removeByName(pools, "PDL")
        f_addLevel(pools, pdH, 1, 1, "PDH", time, 0, poolCap, showLevels)
        f_addLevel(pools, pdL, -1, 1, "PDL", time, 0, poolCap, showLevels)
    if usePDWL and newWeek
        f_removeByName(pools, "PWH")
        f_removeByName(pools, "PWL")
        f_addLevel(pools, pwH, 1, 1, "PWH", time, 0, poolCap, showLevels)
        f_addLevel(pools, pwL, -1, 1, "PWL", time, 0, poolCap, showLevels)
    // ── rank 2: 1H swings / equal highs-lows; 1H PD arrays (values of the closed 1H bar)
    if htfNew
        if use1HSwings
            if not na(h_ph)
                f_add1HSwing(1, h_ph, h_pivT)
            if not na(h_pl)
                f_add1HSwing(-1, h_pl, h_pivT)
        if nz(h_fDir) != 0
            f_addZone(h_fTop, h_fBot, h_fDir, 0, h_fT)
        if nz(h_obDir) != 0
            f_addZone(h_obTop, h_obBot, h_obDir, 1, h_obT)
    // ── rank 3: session highs / lows (pushed when the session ends)
    bool endAsia   = f_sessStep(stAsia, inAsia)
    bool endLondon = f_sessStep(stLondon, inLondon)
    bool endMain   = f_sessStep(stMain, inMain)
    if useSessLiq
        if endAsia
            f_removeByName(pools, "ASIA H")
            f_removeByName(pools, "ASIA L")
            f_addLevel(pools, stAsia.fhi, 1, 3, "ASIA H", time, 2, poolCap, showLevels)
            f_addLevel(pools, stAsia.flo, -1, 3, "ASIA L", time, 2, poolCap, showLevels)
        if endLondon
            f_removeByName(pools, "LDN H")
            f_removeByName(pools, "LDN L")
            f_addLevel(pools, stLondon.fhi, 1, 3, "LDN H", time, 2, poolCap, showLevels)
            f_addLevel(pools, stLondon.flo, -1, 3, "LDN L", time, 2, poolCap, showLevels)
        if endMain
            f_removeByName(pools, "SESS H")
            f_removeByName(pools, "SESS L")
            f_addLevel(pools, stMain.fhi, 1, 3, "SESS H", time, 2, poolCap, showLevels)
            f_addLevel(pools, stMain.flo, -1, 3, "SESS L", time, 2, poolCap, showLevels)
    // ── rank 4: internal 5M swings
    if useIntPools
        if not na(iph)
            f_addLevel(intPools, iph, 1, 4, "iH", time[ltfIntPivotLen], 3, maxZones, showLevels and showIntLevels)
        if not na(ipl)
            f_addLevel(intPools, ipl, -1, 4, "iL", time[ltfIntPivotLen], 3, maxZones, showLevels and showIntLevels)

    // ── per-direction state machines
    for i = 0 to 1
        int   d = i == 0 ? 1 : -1
        Setup s = array.get(setups, i)
        if f_isTerminal(s.state) and bar_index > s.endBar
            string lr = s.result
            s := f_newSetup(d)
            s.lastResult := lr
            array.set(setups, i, s)
        array.clear(s.events)
        bool idleStart = s.state == ST_IDLE
        // sweep detection (consumes every swept level, every bar)
        [b1, r1, n1] = f_sweepScan(pools, d, float(na), int(na), "")
        [b2, r2, n2] = f_sweepScan(intPools, d, b1, r1, n1)
        if htfNew and not idleStart and not f_isTerminal(s.state)
            f_htfCheck(s)
        int st = s.state
        if not idleStart and not f_isTerminal(st)
            if st == ST_WAIT_MSS or st == ST_WAIT_REC or st == ST_MSS
                f_stepPre(s)
            else if st == ST_WATCH2
                f_stepWatch2(s)
            else if st == ST_ARMED
                f_stepArmed(s)
            else if st == ST_INTRADE or st == ST_TRAIL
                f_stepTrade(s)
            else if st == ST_REWATCH
                f_stepRewatch(s)
        if idleStart and not na(r2)
            f_tryC1(s, b2, r2, n2)
        if flatEOD and session.islastbar_regular
            f_eod(s)
        array.set(busy, i, s.state == ST_ARMED or s.state == ST_INTRADE or s.state == ST_TRAIL)

    // ── acceptance / zone taps (after sweep evaluation of this bar)
    f_acceptScan(pools)
    f_acceptScan(intPools)
    f_tapZones()

// ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
// ALERTS
// ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
f_evName(Setup s, string c) =>
    switch c
        "C1"       => "C1 detected"
        "RECLAIM"  => "C-grade reclaim"
        "MSS"      => "MSS confirmed"
        "ARMED"    => "Setup ARMED (score " + str.tostring(s.score) + ")"
        "ENTRY"    => "Entry triggered"
        "E5"       => "E5 second-sweep reclaim"
        "TP1"      => "TP1 hit"
        "TP2"      => "TP2 / runner hit"
        "BE"       => "Move SL to BE"
        "TRAIL"    => "Trail stop moved"
        "TIMESTOP" => "Time stop — scratch"
        "REENTRY"  => "Re-entry signal (E5, half risk)"
        "INVALID"  => "Setup invalidated"
        "EXIT"     => "Position closed"
        => c

f_evOn(string c) =>
    switch c
        "C1"       => alC1
        "RECLAIM"  => alReclaim
        "MSS"      => alMSS
        "ARMED"    => alArmed
        "ENTRY"    => alEntry
        "E5"       => alE5
        "TP1"      => alTP1
        "TP2"      => alTP2
        "BE"       => alBE
        "TRAIL"    => alTrail
        "TIMESTOP" => alTime
        "REENTRY"  => alReentry
        "INVALID"  => alInvalid
        "EXIT"     => alExit
        => false

f_json(Setup s, string c) =>
    int d = s.direction
    "{\"ticker\":\"" + syminfo.ticker + "\",\"tf\":\"" + timeframe.period + "\",\"dir\":\"" + (d == 1 ? "LONG" : "SHORT") + "\",\"event\":\"" + f_evName(s, c) + "\",\"state\":\"" + f_stName(s.state) + "\",\"grade\":\"" + f_gradeTxt(s.grade) + "\",\"risk\":\"" + f_riskTxt(s.risk) + "\",\"score\":" + (na(s.score) ? "null" : str.tostring(s.score)) + ",\"model\":\"" + f_modelShort(s.entryModel) + "\",\"entry\":" + f_num(d * s.entry1) + ",\"entry2\":" + f_num(d * s.entry2) + ",\"stop\":" + f_num(d * s.stop) + ",\"tp1\":" + f_num(d * s.tp1) + ",\"tp2\":" + f_num(d * s.tp2) + ",\"rr\":" + (na(s.rr) ? "null" : str.tostring(s.rr, "#.##")) + ",\"qty\":" + (na(s.qty) ? "null" : str.tostring(s.qty)) + ",\"realizedR\":" + str.tostring(s.realizedR, "#.##") + "}"

if barstate.isconfirmed
    for s in setups
        for e in s.events
            if f_evOn(e)
                alert(f_json(s, e), alert.freq_once_per_bar_close)

Setup sL = array.get(setups, 0)
Setup sS = array.get(setups, 1)

// ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
// VISUALS — level extension, dealing range, TF warning, dashboard
// ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
var line rngHiLn = na
var line rngLoLn = na
var line rngEqLn = na
var box  premBx  = na
var box  discBx  = na
var label tfWarn = na

if barstate.islast
    for lv in pools
        if not lv.consumed and not na(lv.ln)
            line.set_x2(lv.ln, time)
            label.set_x(lv.lb, time)
    for lv in intPools
        if not lv.consumed and not na(lv.ln)
            line.set_x2(lv.ln, time)
            label.set_x(lv.lb, time)
    for z in zones
        if not z.tapped and not na(z.bx)
            box.set_right(z.bx, time)
    if showRange and not na(rHigh)
        int x1 = nz(math.min(h_SHt, h_SLt), time - 50 * tfMs)
        if na(rngHiLn)
            rngHiLn := line.new(x1, rHigh, time, rHigh, xloc = xloc.bar_time, color = color.new(colHiLiq, 30), width = 1, style = line.style_dashed)
            rngLoLn := line.new(x1, rLow, time, rLow, xloc = xloc.bar_time, color = color.new(colLoLiq, 30), width = 1, style = line.style_dashed)
            rngEqLn := line.new(x1, rEq, time, rEq, xloc = xloc.bar_time, color = color.new(colNeutral, 20), width = 1, style = line.style_dotted)
        else
            line.set_xy1(rngHiLn, x1, rHigh)
            line.set_xy2(rngHiLn, time, rHigh)
            line.set_xy1(rngLoLn, x1, rLow)
            line.set_xy2(rngLoLn, time, rLow)
            line.set_xy1(rngEqLn, x1, rEq)
            line.set_xy2(rngEqLn, time, rEq)
        if showPD
            if na(premBx)
                premBx := box.new(x1, rHigh, time, rEq, xloc = xloc.bar_time, border_color = color(na), bgcolor = color.new(colBear, 94), text = "premium", text_size = size.tiny, text_color = color.new(colBear, 50), text_halign = text.align_left, text_valign = text.align_top)
                discBx := box.new(x1, rEq, time, rLow, xloc = xloc.bar_time, border_color = color(na), bgcolor = color.new(colBull, 94), text = "discount", text_size = size.tiny, text_color = color.new(colBull, 50), text_halign = text.align_left, text_valign = text.align_bottom)
            else
                box.set_lefttop(premBx, x1, rHigh)
                box.set_rightbottom(premBx, time, rEq)
                box.set_lefttop(discBx, x1, rEq)
                box.set_rightbottom(discBx, time, rLow)
    label.delete(tfWarn)
    if not tfOK
        tfWarn := label.new(bar_index, high, "LSM: built for the " + ltfExpected + "-minute chart — " + (allowAnyTF ? "override ON (results unreliable)" : "signals DISABLED"), style = label.style_label_down, color = color.new(colStop, 10), textcolor = color.white, size = size.normal)

f_tblPos(string p) =>
    switch p
        "Top left"     => position.top_left
        "Bottom right" => position.bottom_right
        "Bottom left"  => position.bottom_left
        "Middle right" => position.middle_right
        => position.top_right

var table dash = table.new(f_tblPos(dashPos), 3, 27, bgcolor = color.new(chart.bg_color, 5), frame_color = color.new(colNeutral, 50), frame_width = 1, border_color = color.new(colNeutral, 80), border_width = 1)

f_cell(int c, int r, string tx, color tc) =>
    table.cell(dash, c, r, tx, text_color = tc, text_size = size.small, text_halign = c == 0 ? text.align_left : text.align_center)

f_stColor(int st) =>
    st == ST_ARMED ? colEntry : (st == ST_INTRADE or st == ST_TRAIL or st == ST_DONE) ? colTarget : (st == ST_INVALID or st == ST_STOPPED) ? colStop : (st == ST_SKIPPED or st == ST_CANCELLED or st == ST_IDLE) ? colNeutral : chart.fg_color

f_dashSetup(int c, Setup s) =>
    int   d   = s.direction
    bool  act = s.state != ST_IDLE
    color fg  = chart.fg_color
    string e  = s.entryModel == 2 ? f_fmt(d * s.entry1) + " / " + f_fmt(d * s.entry2) : f_fmt(d * s.entry1)
    f_cell(c, 7,  f_stName(s.state), f_stColor(s.state))
    f_cell(c, 8,  act ? s.levelName + " (rank " + str.tostring(s.levelRank) + ")" : "—", fg)
    f_cell(c, 9,  act ? f_gradeTxt(s.grade) : "—", s.grade == 3 ? colA : s.grade == 2 ? colB : s.grade == 1 ? colC : fg)
    f_cell(c, 10, act ? (s.htfConfirm == -1 ? "pending" : s.htfConfirm == 1 ? "yes" : "no") : "—", fg)
    f_cell(c, 11, act ? f_riskTxt(s.risk) + (s.riskWhy != "" ? " · " + s.riskWhy : "") : "—", s.risk == 2 ? colStop : s.risk == 1 ? colB : fg)
    f_cell(c, 12, f_dispTxt(s.dispStrength) + (s.mssType == 2 ? " · MSS" : s.mssType == 1 ? " · iMSS" : ""), fg)
    f_cell(c, 13, na(s.score) ? "—" : str.tostring(s.score) + "/7", na(s.score) ? fg : s.score >= 6 ? colTarget : s.score >= 4 ? colB : colNeutral)
    f_cell(c, 14, f_modelShort(s.entryModel) + (s.starter ? " starter" : "") + (s.isReentry ? " re-entry" : "") + (not na(s.entry4) ? " (+E4)" : ""), fg)
    f_cell(c, 15, e, colEntry)
    f_cell(c, 16, f_fmt(d * s.stop) + (s.stopTxt != "" ? " · " + s.stopTxt : ""), colStop)
    f_cell(c, 17, f_fmt(d * s.tp1) + " · " + f_fmtR(f_r(s, s.tp1)), colTarget)
    f_cell(c, 18, f_fmt(d * s.tp2) + " · " + f_fmtR(f_r(s, s.tp2)), colTarget)
    f_cell(c, 19, na(s.rr) ? "—" : str.tostring(s.rr, "#.##"), na(s.rr) ? fg : s.rr >= minRR ? colTarget : colStop)
    f_cell(c, 20, na(s.qty) ? "—" : str.tostring(s.qty), fg)
    f_cell(c, 21, str.tostring(s.reentryCount) + "/1", fg)
    f_cell(c, 22, (s.flagsAgg != "" ? "▲ " + s.flagsAgg : "") + (s.flagsWait != "" ? " ▼ " + s.flagsWait : "") + (s.note != "" ? " · " + s.note : ""), fg)
    f_cell(c, 23, s.state == ST_INTRADE or s.state == ST_TRAIL ? "open · realised " + f_fmtR(s.realizedR) : s.result != "" ? s.result : s.lastResult != "" ? s.lastResult : "—", fg)
    true

if showDash and barstate.islast
    color fg = chart.fg_color
    float rp = na(rHigh) or rHigh == rLow ? na : (close - rLow) / (rHigh - rLow) * 100
    f_cell(0, 0, "LSM 1H/5M", fg)
    f_cell(1, 0, "LONG", colBull)
    f_cell(2, 0, "SHORT", colBear)
    f_cell(0, 1, "1H bias", fg)
    f_cell(1, 1, f_biasTxt(h_bias) + (h_choch != 0 ? " (CHoCH " + (h_choch == 1 ? "↑" : "↓") + ")" : ""), h_bias == 1 ? colBull : h_bias == -1 ? colBear : colNeutral)
    f_cell(0, 2, "Bias TF (" + biasTF + ")", fg)
    f_cell(1, 2, f_biasTxt(b4Bias), b4Bias == 1 ? colBull : b4Bias == -1 ? colBear : colNeutral)
    f_cell(0, 3, "Aligned", fg)
    f_cell(1, 3, htfAligned ? "yes" : "no", htfAligned ? colTarget : colStop)
    f_cell(0, 4, "Range position", fg)
    f_cell(1, 4, na(rp) ? "—" : str.tostring(rp, "#") + "% " + (rp < 50 ? "(discount)" : "(premium)"), na(rp) ? fg : rp < 50 ? colBull : colBear)
    f_cell(0, 5, "Min into hour", fg)
    f_cell(1, 5, (na(minIntoHour) ? "—" : str.tostring(minIntoHour, "#")) + (earlyInHour ? " · early" : "") + (na(hourOpen) ? "" : close < hourOpen ? " · below hour open" : " · above hour open"), fg)
    f_cell(0, 6, "Session window", fg)
    f_cell(1, 6, winName + (inBlackout ? " · NEWS" : "") + (tfOK ? "" : " · TF!"), inPrime ? colTarget : inBlackout or not tfOK ? colStop : fg)
    f_cell(0, 7, "State", fg)
    f_cell(0, 8, "Level swept", fg)
    f_cell(0, 9, "C1 grade", fg)
    f_cell(0, 10, "1H confirm", fg)
    f_cell(0, 11, "2nd-sweep risk", fg)
    f_cell(0, 12, "Displacement", fg)
    f_cell(0, 13, "Score", fg)
    f_cell(0, 14, "Model (★ rec.)", fg)
    f_cell(0, 15, "Entry", fg)
    f_cell(0, 16, "Stop", fg)
    f_cell(0, 17, "TP1", fg)
    f_cell(0, 18, "TP2", fg)
    f_cell(0, 19, "R:R", fg)
    f_cell(0, 20, "Qty", fg)
    f_cell(0, 21, "Re-entries", fg)
    f_cell(0, 22, "Flags", fg)
    f_cell(0, 23, "Result", fg)
    f_cell(0, 24, "Funnel C1·rej·MSS·arm·skip·canc", fg)
    f_cell(0, 25, "Last drop-out", fg)
    for i = 0 to 1
        string fn = str.tostring(array.get(diag, i)) + " · " + str.tostring(array.get(diag, 2 + i)) + " · " + str.tostring(array.get(diag, 4 + i)) + " · " + str.tostring(array.get(diag, 6 + i)) + " · " + str.tostring(array.get(diag, 8 + i)) + " · " + str.tostring(array.get(diag, 10 + i))
        f_cell(i + 1, 24, fn, fg)
        f_cell(i + 1, 25, array.get(lastWhy, i) == "" ? "—" : array.get(lastWhy, i), colNeutral)
    f_dashSetup(1, sL)
    f_dashSetup(2, sS)

// ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
// DATA WINDOW / PINE SCREENER OUTPUTS
// ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
f_prio(int st) =>
    st == ST_INTRADE or st == ST_TRAIL ? 5 : st == ST_ARMED ? 4 : (st == ST_WAIT_MSS or st == ST_WAIT_REC or st == ST_MSS) ? 3 : (st == ST_WATCH2 or st == ST_REWATCH) ? 2 : st == ST_IDLE ? 0 : 1
Setup sP = f_prio(sL.state) >= f_prio(sS.state) ? sL : sS
int   dP = sP.direction
bool  armedL = sL.state == ST_ARMED or (sL.state == ST_INTRADE and sL.armBar == bar_index)
bool  armedS = sS.state == ST_ARMED or (sS.state == ST_INTRADE and sS.armBar == bar_index)
plot(sP.state, "LSM state code", display = display.data_window)
plot(sP.score, "LSM score", display = display.data_window)
plot(sP.state == ST_IDLE ? 0 : dP, "LSM direction", display = display.data_window)
plot(sP.grade, "LSM grade (3A/2B/1C)", display = display.data_window)
plot(sP.risk, "LSM risk (0/1/2)", display = display.data_window)
plot(sP.rr, "LSM R:R", display = display.data_window)
plot(dP * sP.entry1, "LSM entry", display = display.data_window)
plot(dP * sP.stop, "LSM stop", display = display.data_window)
plot(dP * sP.tp1, "LSM TP1", display = display.data_window)
plot(armedL ? 1 : armedS ? -1 : 0, "LSM signal (1 long / -1 short)", display = display.data_window)

// ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
// PHASE 2 · ORDER ROUTING — mirror the engine's decisions in the broker emulator
// ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
//  Entry ids per direction: "<L|S>1" tier-1 / single entry · "<L|S>2" E2 tier-2 limit · "<L|S>A" E5 add.
//  Exit ids: "-TP1" (tp1Pct) · "-TP2" · "-RUN"; all carry the engine's current stop (BE / trail).
//  Exit percentages are re-issued relative to the REMAINING position at each stage.
f_ordComment(Setup s) =>
    f_modelShort(s.entryModel) + "·" + f_gradeTxt(s.grade) + "·" + f_riskTxt(s.risk) + "·s" + str.tostring(s.score)

f_route(Setup s) =>
    int    d      = s.direction
    string p      = d == 1 ? "L" : "S"
    bool   engIn  = s.state == ST_INTRADE or s.state == ST_TRAIL
    bool   posDir = d == 1 ? strategy.position_size > 0 : strategy.position_size < 0
    // ── E1 limit (also MODERATE-risk starters)
    if s.state == ST_ARMED and s.entryModel == 1 and s.q1 > 0
        strategy.entry(p + "1", d == 1 ? strategy.long : strategy.short, qty = s.q1, limit = d * s.entry1, comment = f_ordComment(s))
    else if not engIn
        strategy.cancel(p + "1")
    // ── market fills on the signal close (E2 tier-1, E3, E5, E5 re-entry)
    if engIn and s.fillBar == bar_index and s.entryModel != 1 and s.q1 > 0 and not posDir
        strategy.entry(p + "1", d == 1 ? strategy.long : strategy.short, qty = s.q1, comment = f_ordComment(s))
    // ── E2 tier-2 limit at the FVG top edge
    if engIn and s.entryModel == 2 and not s.t2Filled and not s.tp1Hit and s.q2 > 0
        strategy.entry(p + "2", d == 1 ? strategy.long : strategy.short, qty = s.q2, limit = d * s.entry2, comment = "E2b")
    else
        strategy.cancel(p + "2")
    // ── E5 add of the main size (MODERATE-risk starter)
    if engIn and s.starter and s.addQty > 0 and array.includes(s.events, "E5")
        strategy.entry(p + "A", d == 1 ? strategy.long : strategy.short, qty = s.addQty, comment = "E5 add")
    // ── exits
    if engIn
        float st = d * s.stop
        float t1 = d * s.tp1
        float t2 = na(s.tp2) ? t1 : d * s.tp2
        bool  hasRun = not na(s.runner) and not na(s.tp2)
        if not s.tp1Hit
            strategy.exit(p + "-TP1", qty_percent = tp1Pct, limit = t1, stop = st, comment_profit = "TP1", comment_loss = "SL")
            strategy.exit(p + "-TP2", qty_percent = hasRun ? (100 - tp1Pct) / 2.0 : 100, limit = t2, stop = st, comment_profit = "TP2", comment_loss = "SL")
        else
            strategy.cancel(p + "-TP1")
            if not s.tp2Hit
                strategy.exit(p + "-TP2", qty_percent = hasRun ? 50 : 100, limit = t2, stop = st, comment_profit = "TP2", comment_loss = "SL/BE")
            else
                strategy.cancel(p + "-TP2")
        if hasRun
            strategy.exit(p + "-RUN", qty_percent = 100, limit = d * s.runner, stop = st, comment_profit = "Runner", comment_loss = "Trail")
        else
            strategy.cancel(p + "-RUN")
    else
        strategy.cancel(p + "-TP1")
        strategy.cancel(p + "-TP2")
        strategy.cancel(p + "-RUN")
        // engine is flat (time stop, invalidation, EOD, or a stop the emulator missed) → sync
        if posDir
            strategy.close_all(comment = s.result != "" ? s.result : "sync")
    true

if barstate.isconfirmed and placeOrders
    f_route(sL)
    f_route(sS)

// ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
// PHASE 2 · R STATISTICS TABLE + TRADE LOG
// ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
var array<string> bNames = array.from("All trades", "E1 FVG retest", "E2 tiered", "E3 continuation", "E4 1M refine", "E5 2nd sweep", "Grade A", "Grade B", "Grade C", "Risk LOW", "Risk MOD", "Risk HIGH", "Opening vol", "Prime", "Midday", "Afternoon", "Late session", "Long", "Short")
var table stats = table.new(f_tblPos(statsPos), 6, NB + 5 + logRows, bgcolor = color.new(chart.bg_color, 5), frame_color = color.new(colNeutral, 50), frame_width = 1, border_color = color.new(colNeutral, 80), border_width = 1)

f_sc(int c, int r, string tx, color tc) =>
    table.cell(stats, c, r, tx, text_color = tc, text_size = size.small, text_halign = c == 0 ? text.align_left : text.align_right)

if showStats and barstate.islast
    color fg = chart.fg_color
    f_sc(0, 0, "LSM R ledger", fg)
    f_sc(1, 0, "n", fg)
    f_sc(2, 0, "Win %", fg)
    f_sc(3, 0, "Avg R", fg)
    f_sc(4, 0, "Total R", fg)
    f_sc(5, 0, "PF", fg)
    for i = 0 to NB - 1
        float n   = array.get(bN, i)
        float sm  = array.get(bSum, i)
        float gp  = array.get(bGP, i)
        float gl  = array.get(bGL, i)
        color rc  = n == 0 ? colNeutral : sm > 0 ? colTarget : sm < 0 ? colStop : fg
        bool  sep = i == 1 or i == 6 or i == 9 or i == 12 or i == 17
        f_sc(0, i + 1, (sep ? "· " : "") + array.get(bNames, i), i == 0 ? fg : color.new(fg, 15))
        f_sc(1, i + 1, str.tostring(n, "#"), fg)
        f_sc(2, i + 1, n > 0 ? str.tostring(array.get(bWin, i) / n * 100, "#") + "%" : "—", fg)
        f_sc(3, i + 1, n > 0 ? f_fmtR(sm / n) : "—", rc)
        f_sc(4, i + 1, n > 0 ? f_fmtR(sm) : "—", rc)
        f_sc(5, i + 1, gl > 0 ? str.tostring(gp / gl, "#.##") : gp > 0 ? "∞" : "—", fg)
    int r0 = NB + 1
    f_sc(0, r0, "Max drawdown", fg)
    f_sc(4, r0, f_fmtR(-array.get(bPeak, 1)), colStop)
    f_sc(0, r0 + 1, "Tester net P&L", fg)
    f_sc(4, r0 + 1, str.tostring(strategy.netprofit, "#,###.##") + " " + syminfo.currency, strategy.netprofit >= 0 ? colTarget : colStop)
    if logRows > 0
        f_sc(0, r0 + 2, "Last trades", fg)
        int nl = math.min(logRows, array.size(logTx))
        if nl > 0
            for j = 0 to nl - 1
                float lr = array.get(logR, j)
                f_sc(0, r0 + 3 + j, array.get(logTx, j), color.new(fg, 15))
                f_sc(4, r0 + 3 + j, f_fmtR(lr), lr > 0 ? colTarget : lr < 0 ? colStop : colNeutral)

// Data-window export (copy from the data window / "Export chart data" for spreadsheet tuning)
plot(array.get(lastTradeBar, 0) == bar_index ? array.get(lastTradeR, 0) : na, "LSM trade R (closed this bar)", display = display.data_window)
plot(array.get(bSum, 0), "LSM cumulative R", display = display.data_window)
plot(array.get(bN, 0), "LSM trades counted", display = display.data_window)
